hadiths[392]{hadithnumber,text}:
"7811","[AI-translation] Ae Aal-e-Muhammad! Tum mein se jo hajj kare wo apne hajj mein umrah ka ihram bandhe."
"7812","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Bakr! Har qaum ki aik eid hoti hai aur ye hamari eid hai."
"7813","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Bakr! Kaho: Allahumma fatirus-samawati wal-arz, aalimul-ghaibi wash-shahadah, la ilaha illa anta rabbu kulli shai'in wa malikuhu, a'uzu bika min sharri nafsi wa min sharrish-shaitani wa shirkihi wa an aqtarifa ala nafsi su'an aw ajurrahu ila muslim."
"7814","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Bakr! Tum do aadmiyon ke baare mein kya gumaan karte ho jin ke saath Allah teesra hai?"
"7815","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Saalba! Jo kuch tumhare kamon ne, tumhare tarbiyat-yafte kuttay ne aur tumhare haath ne tumhari taraf wapas kiya wo tumhare liye halal hai, chahe zibah kiya hua ho ya baghair zibah."
"7816","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Kya tum samajhte ho ke maal ki kasrat hi ghina hai? Ghina to dil ka ghina hai aur faqr dil ka faqr. Jis ke dil mein ghina ho use duniya mein pesh aane wali cheez nuqsan nahi deti, aur jis ke dil mein faqr ho use duniya mein maal ki kasrat kuch faida nahi deti; us ka bukhl hi us ka nuqsan karta hai."
"7817","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Jab tum mahine mein teen din roze rakho to terah, chaudah aur pandrah tarikh ko rakho."
"7818","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Jab salan pakaao to shorba zyada karo aur apne hamsayon ka khayal rakho."
"7819","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Tumhara kya khayal hai agar logon par sakht bhookh aa jaye aur tum apne bistar se masjid tak uthne ki taaqat na rakho to tum kya karoge? Parhez ikhtiyar karo. Ae Abu Zar! Tumhara kya khayal hai agar logon par sakht maut aa jaye aur ghar mein bande ke saath - yani qabr - ho jaye to tum kya karoge? Sabr karo. Ae Abu Zar! Tumhara kya khayal hai agar log aik doosre ko qatl karne lagein yahan tak ke zaitun ke patthar khoon se doob jayen to tum kya karoge? Apne ghar mein baith jao aur apne par darwaza band kar lo. Unhon ne kaha: Agar mujhe chhoda na jaye? Farmaya: To tum jis ke saath ho us ke paas chale jao aur unhi mein shaamil ho jao. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main apna hathiyar uthaun? Farmaya: Tab to tum un ke saath us mein shareek hoge jis mein wo hain; lekin agar tumhein is baat ka andesha ho ke talay ki chamak tumhein rok degi to apni chadar ka kinara apne chehre par daal do taake wo apne gunah aur tumhare gunah ke saath wapas jaye aur dozakh walon mein se ho jaye."
"7820","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Kya main tumhein jannat ke khazanon mein se aik khazana na bataun? 'La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah'."
"7821","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Kya main tumhein aise kalimat na sikhaun jinhein tum kahoge to tum un logon ko paa loge jo tum se aage nikal gaye, aur tum se aage koi nahi barh sakta magar jo tumhare amal ki tarah amal kare: har namaz ke baad tees martaba takbeer, tees martaba tasbeeh aur tees martaba tahmeed karo, aur is ko 'La ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lah, lahul mulku wa lahul hamdu wa huwa ala kulli shai'in qadeer' par khatam karo. Jo ye kahega us ke gunah bakhsh diye jayenge chahe samundar ki jhaag ke barabar hon."
"7822","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Tum aise aadmi ho jis mein jahiliyyat hai. Ye tumhare bhai hain, Allah ne un par tumhein fazilat di hai; pas jo tumhari taraf se mel-jol na rakhe use bech do aur Allah ki makhluq ko azab na do."
"7823","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Tum kamzor ho aur ye amanat hai, aur qayamat ke din ye ruswai aur nedamat hai magar us ke liye jo ise us ke haq ke saath le aur is mein jo zimmedari hai ada kare."
"7824","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Mere baad aise ameer honge jo namaz ko mar denge. Pas namaz apne waqt par parho; agar tum ne apne waqt par parhi to wo tumhare liye nafil hai, warna tum ne apni namaz mehfooz kar li."
"7825","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Main tumhein kamzor dekhta hun aur main tumhare liye wohi pasand karta hun jo apne liye pasand karta hun: do aadmiyon par ameer na bano aur yateem ke maal ke wali na bano."
"7826","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Main nahi chahta ke mere paas Uhud ke barabar sona ho aur teesra din aaye jab mere paas us mein se aik dinar bhi ho magar wo dinar jo main kisi qarz ke liye rakhoon, yahan tak ke main use Allah ke bandon mein is tarah, is tarah, is tarah kharch kar dun. Ae Abu Zar! Kasrat-e-maal wale hi sawab mein kam hain magar jo is tarah, is tarah kahe."
"7827","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Main nahi chahta ke mere paas Uhud ke barabar sona ho aur main use poora kharch kar dun magar teen dinare."
"7828","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Zar! Kya tum jaante ho suraj kahan jata hai jab wo doob jata hai? Wo jata hai yahan tak ke Arsh ke paas pahunchta hai aur apne Rab ke saamne sajda karta hai, phir wapas aane ki ijazat maangta hai to use ijazat di jati hai; aur goya us se kaha gaya ho: Jahan se aaya wahan se utar, pas wo maghrib se tulu karta hai. Yehi uska mustaqar hai."
"7829","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Saeed! Jo Allah ke Rab hone, Islam ke deen hone aur Muhammad ke nabi hone par raazi ho gaya us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi, aur aik aur cheez hai jis se bande ko jannat mein sau darje buland kiye jate hain, har do darjon ke darmiyan aasman o zameen jitna fasla hai: Allah ki raah mein jihad, Allah ki raah mein jihad."
"7830","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Umair! Nughair ka kya hua?"
"7831","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Musa! Tumhein Aal-e-Dawud ke mazameer mein se aik mizmar diya gaya hai."
"7832","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Hurairah! Qalam khooshk ho gaya us par jo tumhein milne wala hai; pas is par qaim raho ya chhod do."
"7833","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Hurairah! Parhezgar ban jao to tum sab se zyada ibadat karne wale ho; Allah ne jo tumhein diya us par raazi ho jao to tum sab se ghani ho; Musalmanon aur mominon ke liye wohi pasand karo jo apne liye aur apne ghar walon ke liye pasand karte ho, aur un ke liye wohi na-pasand karo jo apne liye aur apne ghar walon ke liye na-pasand karte ho, to tum momin hoge; aur apne hamsaya ke saath achhai kar ke raho to tum Musalman hoge; aur zyada hansne se bacho kyunke zyada hansna dil ko kharab kar deta hai."
"7834","[AI-translation] Ae ibn Adam! Beshak tum fuzool maal kharch karo to ye tumhare liye behtar hai aur agar rok lo to tumhare liye bura hai; aur kifayat ke barabar par tumhari malamat nahi hoti; aur un se shuru karo jinki parwarish tumhare zimme hai; aur upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai."
"7835","[AI-translation] Ae Ibn Akwa! Tumhein qudrat mili hai pas narmi ikhtiyar karo."
"7836","[AI-translation] Ae Ibn Khasasiya! Tum ne is subah Allah par kya aib-joi shuru ki hai? Tum is waqt Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath chal rahe ho."
"7837","[AI-translation] Ae Ibn Khattab! Jao aur logon mein nida do ke jannat mein sirf momin dakhil honge."
"7838","[AI-translation] Ae Ibn Hawala! Jab tum khilafat ko Arz-e-Muqaddas mein utarta dekho to samajh lo ke zalzele, balayen aur azim muamle qareeb aa gaye, aur us waqt qayamat logon ke bahut qareeb hogi, jitna mera ye haath tumhare sar se qareeb hai."
"7839","[AI-translation] Ae Ibn Aabis! Kya main tumhein woh behtar cheez na bataun jis ke saath panaah maangne wale panaah maangte hain? 'Qul a'uzu bi rabbil falaq' aur 'Qul a'uzu bi rabbin nas', ye do suratein."
"7840","[AI-translation] Ae Ibn Auf! Apna ghoda sawaar karo phir pukaro ke jannat sirf momin ke liye halal hai."
"7841","[AI-translation] Ae Ubayy! Mere Rab tabarak wa taala ne meri taraf wahee bheji ke main Quran aik harf par parhun, to main ne jawab diya: Meri ummat par aasan farma. Phir doosri martaba meri taraf bheja ke do harfon par parhun, main ne phir arz kiya: Meri ummat par aasan farma. Phir teesri martaba meri taraf bheja ke saat harfon par parhun, aur har martaba ke badle jo tum ne wapas kiya tumhare liye aik sawal hai jo tum mujh se karo ge. Main ne kaha: Allahumma ighfir li ummati, Allahumma ighfir li ummati. Aur teesri baat main ne us din ke liye utha rakhi hai jab tamam makhluq, yahan tak ke Ibrahim bhi, meri taraf raghbat karenge."
"7842","[AI-translation] Ae Ubayy! Quran saat harfon par utara gaya hai, un mein se har aik shafi aur kafi hai."
"7843","[AI-translation] Ae Ubayy! Mujhe Quran parhaya gaya to mujh se kaha gaya: Aik harf par ya do par? Jo farishta mere saath tha us ne kaha: Kaho do par. Main ne kaha: Do par. Phir mujh se kaha gaya: Do par ya teen par? Mere saath ke farishte ne kaha: Kaho teen par. Main ne kaha: Teen par, yahan tak ke saat harf tak pahunch gaya. Phir kaha gaya: In mein se har aik shafi aur kafi hai, chahe tum 'Sami'an Alima' kaho ya 'Azizan Hakima', bashart ke tum azaab ki aayat ko rehmat par aur rehmat ki aayat ko azaab par khatam na karo."
"7844","[AI-translation] Ae mere bhaiyon! Aise din ke liye tayyari karo."
"7845","[AI-translation] Ae Usama! Kya tum Allah ki hudood mein se kisi hadd ke baare mein sifarish karte ho?!"
"7846","[AI-translation] Ae Usama! Qayamat ke din jab 'La ilaha illallah' aa jayegi to tum kya karoge?!"
"7847","[AI-translation] Ae Asma! Jab aurat haiz ko pahunch jaye to us ka koi hissa dekhna durust nahi magar ye aur ye - aur aap ne apne chehre aur hatheliyon ki taraf ishara kiya."
"7848","[AI-translation] Ae Ashaj! Tum mein do khoobiyan hain jinhein Allah pasand karta hai: tahammul aur waqar."
"7849","[AI-translation] Ae Aa'rabi! Beshak Allah Taala Bani Israil ke do girohon par ghazab-nak hua aur unhein zameen par rengne wale janwar bana diya. Pas main nahi jaanta, shayad yehi un mein se ho - yani zab - pas main ise nahi khata aur is se mana bhi nahi karta."
"7850","[AI-translation] ... Behtar saathi chaar hain ... behtar sariya chaar sau hai aur behtar lashkar chaar hazaar hai, aur bara hazaar tadaad ki kami ki wajah se kabhi maqhloob nahi honge."
"7851","[AI-translation] Ae Ummul Ala! Khushkhabri ho, beshak Musalman ki beemari se Allah us ke gunah mitata hai jaise aag sone chandi ka zang door karti hai."
"7852","[AI-translation] Ae Umm-e-Harisa! Wo bageeqa jannat ke andar jannatein hain, aur beshak tumhare bete ko Firdaus-e-Aala mila hai; Firdaus jannat ka buland hissa, uska wast aur uska behtareen hissa hai."
"7853","[AI-translation] Ae Umm-e-Harisa! Wo aik jannat nahi balke bohat si jannatein hain, aur beshak Harisa Firdaus-e-Aala mein hai."
"7854","[AI-translation] Ae Umm-e-Salama! Koi insan aisa nahi magar uska dil Allah ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan hai; pas jise chahe qaim rakhe aur jise chahe tedha kar de."
"7855","[AI-translation] Ae Umm-e-Salama! Ayesha ke maamle mein mujhe takleef na do, kyunke Allah ki qasam, mujh par wahee nahi utri jabke main tum mein se kisi aurat ki chadar mein tha siwaye un ke."
"7856","[AI-translation] Ae Umm-e-Sulaim! Kya tum nahi jaanti ke main ne apne Rab se shart ki thi aur kaha tha: Main bas aik insan hun, insanon ki tarah raazi hota hun aur insanon ki tarah ghazab karta hun; pas meri ummat mein se jis shakhs par main aisi dua kar dun jo us ke laayeq na ho to us dua ko us ke liye paakizgi, zakaat aur aisi qurbat bana de jis se tum qayamat ke din use apne qareeb kar lo."
"7857","[AI-translation] Ae Umm-e-Fulan! Tum raaston ke jis kinare bhi chahe baith jao, main tumhare paas baith jaunga."
"7858","[AI-translation] Ae Anjasha! Aahista chalao, ye sheeshiyan hain."
"7859","[AI-translation] Ae Anas! Log mulk aabaad karenge aur un mein se aik misr jise Basra ya Baseera kaha jayega; pas agar tum us se guzro ya us mein dakhil ho to us ke shor-zameen, us ke chabutre, us ka bazaar aur us ke umara ka darwaza chhodo, aur us ke atraf mein raho, kyunke wahan khassf, qazf, zalzala hoga aur aise log honge jo raat ko honge aur subah bandar aur khuzeer ban jayenge."
"7860","[AI-translation] Ae Quran walo! Witr parho, kyunke Allah witr ko pasand karta hai."
"7861","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Allah se daro, aur agar tum par aik kaana Habshi ghulam bhi ameer bana diya jaye to jab tak wo tumhare darmiyan Allah ki kitab qaim rakhe us ki baat suno aur itaat karo."
"7862","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Apne Rab se daro jis ne tumhein aik jaan se paida kiya aur us se us ka jodi paida ki aur un donon se bohat se mard aur aurteinn phailayin; aur Allah se daro jis ke waseele se tum aik doosre se sawal karte ho, aur rishta-dariyon ka bhi khayal rakho; beshak Allah tum par nigran hai. Ae iman walo! Allah se daro aur har jaan ko dekho ke us ne kal ke liye kya aage bheja; aur Allah se daro, beshak Allah tumhare amal se ba-khabar hai. Aadmi apne dinare se, dirham se, kapde se, gehon ke sa se, khajoor ke sa se sadqa kare, chahe khajoor ka aik tukra ho."
"7863","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Allah ko yaad karo, Allah ko yaad karo. Raa'jifa aa gayi, us ke peechhe Raadifa aayi; Raa'jifa aa gayi, us ke peechhe Raadifa aayi; maut apne saath jo hai le kar aa gayi."
"7864","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Apne aap par narmi karo, kyunke tum na kisi behre ko pukarte ho na gaair-hazir ko; tum Sami' aur Qareeb ko pukarte ho aur wo tumhare saath hai."
"7865","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Salam phailao, khana khilao, rishtedari jodo aur raat ko namaz parho jab log so rahe hon, tum salaamati ke saath jannat mein dakhil ho jao ge."
"7866","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, aur ye kisi ki maut ya zindagi ki wajah se ghehen nahi hote. Pas jab tum in mein se kuch dekho to namaz parho yahan tak ke wo chhal jaye. Beshak har cheez jis ka tumhein wada diya gaya hai main ne isi namaz mein dekh li hai. Aag laayi gayi, jab tum ne mujhe dekha ke main peeche hat gaya, us ki lapat ke mujhe pahunchne ke darr se, yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Ae mere Rab, aur main unhi mein hun? Aur main ne us mein dekh liya ke chhadi wala apni antariyan aag mein ghasit raha hai; wo hajiyon ko apni chhadi se chori karta tha, agar koi samajh jata to kehta: ye to meri chhadi se latak gaya! Aur agar koi ghaafil hota to wo use le jata. Yahan tak ke main ne us mein wo aurat bhi dekhi jo billi wali thi, jise us ne baandh rakha tha, na use khilaya na use chhoda ke zameen ke keede makore khaye, yahan tak ke wo bhookh se mar gayi. Aur jannat laayi gayi; ye us waqt tha jab tum ne mujhe dekha ke main aage barha yahan tak ke apne maqam par khada ho gaya aur main ne apna haath barhaya, main chahta tha ke us ke phalon mein se kuch le lun taake tum use dekho, phir mujhe ye soojhi ke nahi karun."
"7867","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Beshak Allah ne tum se jahiliyyat ki takabbur aur apne baap-dada par fakhr ko door kar diya hai. Pas log do qism ke hain: aik nek parhezgar jo Allah ke nazdeek izzat wala hai, aur aik bad-kar bad-qismat jo Allah ke nazdeek haqeer hai. Aur log Adam ki aulad hain aur Allah ne Adam ko mitti se paida kiya."
"7868","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum mein kuch log namaz lambi karne wale hain; pas jo logon ki imamat kare wo chhoti kar de, kyunke us ke peechhe kamzor, boodha aur hajat-mand hote hain."
"7869","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Beshak ye tumhare ghanimat ka maal hai, pas dhaaga aur sui bhi ada karo aur us se badi cheez bhi; kyunke ghanimat mein khiyanat qayamat ke din us ke aal-e-kar ke liye ruswai, aib aur aag hai."
"7870","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum Allah ki taraf nange pair, nange jism aur khatna-rawan hokar ikatthe kiye jaoge; jis tarah hum ne pehli paidaish shuru ki wo ise dohrayenge. Dekho! Qayamat ke din sab se pehle Ibrahim ko kapra pehnaya jayega. Dekho! Meri ummat ke aise log laaye jayenge jinhein baayein taraf se pakad liya jayega; to main kahunga: Ae mere Rab! Ye mere ashaab hain. To kaha jayega: Tum nahi jaante ke tumhare baad inhon ne kya nayee cheezein ijaad kiin. Pas main wohi kahunga jo nek bande ne kaha: 'Aur main un par gawah tha jab tak main un mein raha; phir jab tune mujhe utha liya to tu hi un par nigran tha.' To kaha jayega: Ye log jab se tum un se juda hue apni ediyon par murtad hote rahe."
"7871","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum har us cheez ki taaqat nahi rakhte jiska main tumhein hukm deta hun; lekin seedhe raho, qareeb raho aur khushkhabri manaao."
"7872","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Allah ne jo maal tumhein fai ke taur par diya hai us mein se is qadr ke siwa mere liye halal nahi, siwaye panchwin hissa ke, aur wo panchwin hissa bhi tum par wapas kiya jata hai."
"7873","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Is fai mein mera kuch hissa nahi aur na ye - aur aap ne oont ke kohan ki aik baal ki taraf ishara kiya - siwaye panchwin hisse ke, aur panchwin hissa bhi tum par wapas kiya jata hai; pas dhaaga aur sui bhi ada karo."
"7874","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Beshak Shab-e-Qadr mujhe dikhayi gayi thi aur main tumhein us ki khabar dene nikla tha ke do aadmi jhagarte hue aa gaye aur un ke saath shaitan tha, pas main use bhool gaya; tum ise Ramazan ke aakhri das dinon mein talash karo, nauwin, saatwin aur panchwin raat ko talash karo."
"7875","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Zameen par Adam ki aulad paida hone ke baad se aaj tak Dajjal ke fitne se bara koi fitna nahi hua. Aur beshak Allah azza wa jall ne koi nabi nahi bheja magar us ne apni ummat ko Dajjal se daraya. Main aakhri nabi hun aur tum aakhri ummat ho; wo tum mein zaroor niklega. Agar wo mere maujood hone mein nikle to main har Musalman ki taraf se us ka muqabla karunga, aur agar wo mere baad nikle to har shakhs apni taraf se us ka muqabla karega, aur Allah har Musalman par mera khalifa hai. Wo Sham aur Iraq ke darmiyan aik raaste se niklega aur daayein baayein tabahi phailayega. Ae Allah ke bandon! Ae logon! Sabit qadam raho, kyunke main tumhein us ki aisi sifaat bataunga jo mujh se pehle kisi nabi ne nahi batayi. ... Wo kahega: Main tumhara Rab hun; halanke tum apne Rab ko maut tak nahi dekh sakte. Aur wo kaana hoga aur tumhara Rab kaana nahi hai. Aur us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan 'kafir' likha hoga jise har momin padh lega, chahe wo likhna jaanta ho ya na jaanta ho. Aur us ke fitne mein se ye hai ke us ke saath jannat aur aag hogi; us ki aag jannat hogi aur us ki jannat aag. Pas jo us ki aag mein mubtala kiya jaye wo Allah se madad maange aur Surah Kahf ke shuru ki aayatein padhe. ... Aur us ke fitne mein se ye hai ke wo aik Aa'rabi se kahega: Tumhara kya khayal hai, agar main tumhare baap aur maa ko zinda kar dun, kya tum gawahi doge ke main tumhara Rab hun? Wo kahega: Haan. Pas us ke saamne do shaitan us ke baap aur maa ki shakal mein aayenge aur kahenge: Ae bete! Us ki itaat karo, kyunke wo tumhara Rab hai. Aur us ke fitne mein se ye hai ke wo aik jaan par musallat hokar use qatl karega, use aari se chiraga yahan tak ke do tukde ho jayenge, phir kahega: Mere is bande ko dekho, main ise zinda karunga, phir ye dawa karega ke is ka koi Rab hai siwaye mere. Pas Allah use zinda karega aur wo khabees us se poochhega: Tumhara Rab kaun hai? Wo kahega: Mera Rab Allah hai aur tu Allah ka dushman hai, tu Dajjal hai; Allah ki qasam, aaj se pehle main tujhe kabhi itna na pehchanta tha jitna aaj pehchanta hun. Aur us ke fitne mein se ye hai ke wo aasman ko hukm dega ke barse, to wo barsega, aur zameen ko hukm dega ke uge, to wo ugegi. Aur us ke fitne mein se ye hai ke wo aik basti ke paas se guzrega aur us ke log us ki tukzib karenge, to un ke maweshiyon mein se koi bhi baqi nahi rahega jo halak na ho jaye. Aur us ke fitne mein se ye hai ke wo aik basti ke paas se guzrega aur us ke log us ki tasdeeq karenge, to wo aasman ko hukm dega ke barse, to barsega, aur zameen ko hukm dega ke uge, to ugegi, yahan tak ke us din un ke maweshi shaam ko lautenge aur wo sab se mota, sab se bara, sab se zyada pait wala aur sab se zyada doodh dene wala hoga. Aur zameen ka koi hissa aisa nahi bachega jise wo apne qadmon tale na dabaye aur na us par ghalib aaye, siwaye Makkah aur Madinah ke; un ke kisi darre se wo nahi aayega magar wahan farishte nangi talwaron ke saath us ka saamna karenge, yahan tak ke wo Laal Teele ke paas sabkha ke kinare utrega. Pas Madinah apne logon ko teen martaba hila dega, aur us mein koi mard munafiq ya aurat munafiq baqi nahi rahegi magar wo us ki taraf nikal jayegi; is tarah Madinah apni khabasat ko door karega jaise bhatti lohe ki mail ko door karti hai. Aur us din ko 'Yawm-ul-Khalas' kaha jayega. Poocha gaya: Us waqt Arab kahan honge? Farmaya: Wo us waqt thode honge, ... aur un ka imam aik nek aadmi hoga. Chunanche jab un ka imam subah ki namaz parhane ke liye aage barha hoga to Isa bin Maryam subah un par utrenge; pas wo imam peeche hatne lagega taake Isa aage barhein, to Isa apna haath us ke donon kandhon ke darmiyan rakh kar farmayenge: Aage barho aur namaz parhao, kyunke ye tumhare liye qaim ki gayi hai. Pas un ka imam unhein namaz parhayega. Jab wo salaam pherega to Isa farmayenge: Darwaza kholo. To wo kholenge aur us ke peechhe Dajjal hoga, us ke saath sattar hazaar yahudi honge, har aik ke paas sunehre aur chamakdar talwar hoga. Jaise hi Dajjal unhein dekhega wo namak ki tarah paani mein ghal jayega; aur bhaag jayega, ... pas Isa use Lud ke mashriqi darwaze par pakad kar qatl kar denge. Phir Allah yahudiyon ko shikast dega; Allah ki makhluq mein se koi cheez aisi nahi bachegi jis ke peechhe yahudi chhup sake, na patthar, na darakht, na deewar, na janwar, siwaye Gharqad ke; wo un ke darakhton mein se hai jo bolta nahi magar kahega: Ae Allah ke Musalman bande! Ye yahudi hai, aa kar ise qatl kar. Pas Isa bin Maryam meri ummat mein aik adil hakim aur insaf karne wale imam honge; wo saleeb ko todenge, suar ko zibah karenge, jizya rakhenge aur sadqa chhor denge, pas na oont par daudenge na bakri par. Bughz aur dushmani utha li jayegi aur har zee-zahar ka zeher khol diya jayega, yahan tak ke bachcha apna haath saanp ke munh mein daalega to wo use nuqsan nahi dega, aur chhoti ladki sher ke saath khelegi to wo use nuqsan nahi dega; bhediya bheri ke galle mein aisa hoga jaise un ka kutta. Zameen salamati se bhar jayegi jaise bartan paani se bharta hai; baat aik hi hogi, Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibadat nahi hogi; jung apne hathiyar rakh degi; Qureish ki hukumat chhin li jayegi; zameen chandi ke aaine ki tarah hogi jo Adam ke zamane ki tarah apni paidawar ugayegi, yahan tak ke kuch log angur ke aik guchhe par ikatthe honge aur wo unhein seer kar dega, kuch log aik anar par ikatthe honge aur wo unhein seer kar dega; bail itne itne maal ka hoga aur ghoda kuch dirhamon ka hoga, ... Aur Dajjal ke nikalne se pehle teen sakht saal honge jin mein logon par sakht bhookh hogi. Allah pehle saal aasman ko hukm dega ke apni barkat ka aik tihai rok le aur zameen ko hukm dega ke apni paidawar ka aik tihai rok le; phir doosre saal aasman ko hukm dega ke apni barkat ka do tihai rok le aur zameen ko ke apni paidawar ka do tihai rok le; phir teesre saal aasman ko hukm dega aur wo apni poori barkat rok lega, aik qatra nahi barsega, aur zameen ko hukm dega aur wo apni poori paidawar rok legi, kuch hara nahi ugega; pas koi sum-dar janwar baqi nahi rahega magar halak ho jayega siwaye jo Allah chahe. Poocha gaya: Us zamane mein log kaise zinda rahenge? Farmaya: Tehleel, takbeer aur tahmeed; ye un ke liye khane ke barabar hoga."
"7876","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Main tumhara imam hun, pas ruku, sajde, qiyam, quood aur salaam pherne mein mujh se aage na barho, kyunke main tumhein apne aage se bhi dekhta hun aur peeche se bhi. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum wo dekhte jo main ne dekha to tum thoda hanso aur zyada rote."
"7877","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Main ne tum mein aisi cheez chhodi hai ke agar tum use pakad lo to kabhi gumrah na hoge: Allah ki kitab aur meri itrat, yani mere ahle bait."
"7878","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Main ne tumhein aurton se muta ki ijazat di thi aur beshak Allah ne use qayamat tak haram kar diya hai; pas jis ke paas un mein se koi ho wo use raasta de de aur jo kuch tum ne unhein diya hai us mein se kuch na lo."
"7879","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Mominon mein se jise koi musibat pahunche to wo meri musibat se tasalli paaye us musibat ke muqable mein jo use mere siwa kisi aur ki wajah se pahunchi ho; kyunke meri ummat mein se kisi par mere baad koi musibat meri musibat se zyada shiddat ki nahi hogi."
"7880","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Kaunsa din sab se zyada hurmat wala hai? Kaunsa din sab se zyada hurmat wala hai? Kaunsa din sab se zyada hurmat wala hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yawm-ul-Hajj-il-Akbar. Farmaya: Beshak tumhare khoon, tumhare maal aur tumhari izzatein tum par haram hain jaise tumhare is din ki, tumhare is shehar ki aur tumhare is mahine ki hurmat hai. Suno! Koi jaan apne siwa kisi aur ka gunah nahi uthayegi; suno! Na baap apni aulad ka gunah uthayega na aulad apne baap ka. Suno! Shaitan ko is baat se na-umeedi ho gayi hai ke tumhare is shehar mein kabhi us ki ibadat ki jayegi, lekin tumhare aise amaal mein jinka tum haqeer samajhte ho us ki itaat hogi aur wo is par raazi ho jayega. Suno! Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai; pas kisi Musalman ke liye apne bhai ka koi maal halal nahi magar jo wo khushi se de de. Suno! Jahiliyyat ka har sood maaf hai; tumhare asal maal tumhare hain, na tum par zulm hoga na tum zulm karoge, siwaye Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib ke sood ke, kyunke wo poora maaf hai. Aur jahiliyyat ka har khoon maaf hai, aur jahiliyyat ke khoon mein se sab se pehle jo main maaf karta hun wo Haris bin Abdul Muttalib ka khoon hai. Suno! Aurton ke baare mein achhai ki wasiyat qabool karo, kyunke wo tumhare paas qaidi ki tarah hain; tum un par is ke siwa kisi cheez ka ikhtiyar nahi rakhte ke wo khuli be-hayai karen; agar wo aisa karen to unhein bistar mein akela chhod do aur aisi maarna jo sakht na ho; pas agar wo tumhari itaat karen to un par koi raasta na dhoondo. Suno! Beshak tumhara aurton par haq hai aur aurton ka tum par haq hai. Tumhara un par haq ye hai ke wo tumhare bistar par aise shakhs ko na aane den jise tum na-pasand karo aur na tumhare gharon mein aise shakhs ko aane ki ijazat den jise tum na-pasand karo. Suno! Aur un ka tum par haq ye hai ke tum unhein kapde aur khane mein achhai ke saath rakho."
"7881","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Apne Rab ki taraf tauba karo; Allah ki qasam, main din mein sau martaba Allah azza wa jall ki taraf tauba karta hun."
"7882","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Mujh se apne manasik seekh lo, kyunke main nahi jaanta shayad is saal ke baad main hajj na kar sakun."
"7883","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Meri chadar mujhe wapas do. Allah ki qasam, agar mere paas Tihama ke darakhton ke barabar oont hotay to main unhein tum par taqseem kar deta, phir tum mujhe na bakheel paoge, na buzdil, na jhoota. Ae logon! Is fai mein mera kuch hissa nahi aur na ye baal, siwaye panchwin hisse ke, aur panchwin hissa bhi tum mein wapas kiya jata hai; pas dhaaga aur sui ada karo, kyunke ghanimat mein khiyanat qayamat ke din us ke aal-e-kar ke liye ruswai, aag aur aib hai."
"7884","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tumhein sukoon se chalna chahiye, kyunke neki ghode aur oont daurane mein nahi hai."
"7885","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum par sukoon aur waqar laazim hai, kyunke neki oonton ko tez daurane mein nahi hai."
"7886","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum par iqtisad laazim hai, tum par iqtisad laazim hai, tum par iqtisad laazim hai; kyunke Allah taala amal ka sawab dena tab tak nahi chhodega jab tak tum khud amal se nahi thak jao."
"7887","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum utne amal karo jitni taaqat rakhte ho, kyunke Allah tab tak nahi uktaega jab tak tum ukta nahi jate; aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se pasandida amal wo hai jis par hamesha kiya jaye chahe wo thoda ho."
"7888","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tumhein kya ho gaya ke namaz mein jab tumhein koi baat pesh aayi to tum ne taaliyan bajani shuru kar din? Taaliyan to aurton ke liye hain. Jise namaz mein koi baat pesh aaye wo 'Subhanallah' kahe; kyunke jab wo 'Subhanallah' kahega to use sunne wala har shakhs us ki taraf mutawajjeh hoga."
"7889","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Kya tum jaante ho main ne tumhein kyun ikattha kiya hai? Allah ki qasam, main ne tumhein kisi raghbat ya kisi darr ki wajah se ikattha nahi kiya, balke main ne tumhein is liye ikattha kiya ke Tamim Dari aik Nasrani aadmi tha, wo aaya, baiat ki aur Musalman hua, aur us ne mujhe aisi hadith sunayi jo us se milti hai jo main tumhein Masih Dajjal ke baare mein sunata tha. Us ne mujhe bataya ke wo tees aadmiyon ke saath Lakhm aur Juzam qabile ke logon mein se aik samundari jahaz par sawaar hua; pas ek mahina lehron ne unhein khelaya, phir wo suraj doobne ke waqt samundar ke aik jazeere ke kinare pahunche; wo apni kashti ke sab se qareeb baith gaye, phir jazeere mein utre; wahan unhein aik aisa janwar mila jis par bohat baal the, wo itne zyada the ke us ke aage aur peeche ka pata nahi chalta tha. Unhon ne kaha: Tera halak ho, tu kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main Jassasa hun. Unhon ne kaha: Jassasa kya hai? Us ne kaha: Ae logo! Us deir mein is aadmi ke paas jao, kyunke wo tumhari khabar ka shauqmand hai. Us ne kaha: Jab us ne humein aik aadmi ka zikr kiya to humein darr laga ke kahin wo shaitani aurat na ho, pas hum tezi se chal pade yahan tak ke deir ke darwaze mein dakhil hue. Wahan hum ne aisa azim-ul-jism insan dekha jo hum ne kabhi nahi dekha tha, aur sakht bandhan mein tha; us ke donon haath gardan se aur donon ghutno se takhno tak lohe se bandhe hue the. Hum ne kaha: Tera halak ho, tu kya hai? Us ne kaha: Tum meri khabar par qaabiz ho, pas mujhe batao tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Hum Arab ke log hain, hum aik samundari jahaz par sawaar hue, samundar khola hua mila aur lehron ne ek mahina humein khelaya, phir hum tere is jazeere ke kinare aaye, apni kashti ke sab se qareeb utre aur jazeere mein dakhil hue; wahan humein bohat baalon wala aik janwar mila jis ke aage peeche ka pata baalon ki kasrat se nahi chalta tha. Hum ne kaha: Tera halak ho, tu kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main Jassasa hun. Hum ne kaha: Jassasa kya hai? Us ne kaha: Us deir mein is aadmi ke paas jao, kyunke wo tumhari khabar ka shauqmand hai. Pas hum tezi se teri taraf aaye aur us se dare, aur humein yaqeen na hua ke wo shaitani aurat na ho. Us ne kaha: Mujhe Baisan ke khajoor ke darakhton ke baare mein batao. Hum ne kaha: Tu kis cheez ke baare mein poochh raha hai? Us ne kaha: Main tum se un ke darakhton ke baare mein poochhta hun, kya wo phal dete hain? Hum ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Jald hi aisa hoga ke wo phal dena band kar denge. Us ne kaha: Mujhe Tabariya ke talaab ke baare mein batao. Hum ne kaha: Tu kis cheez ke baare mein poochh raha hai? Us ne kaha: Kya us mein paani hai? Hum ne kaha: Us mein bohat paani hai. Us ne kaha: Jald hi uska paani khatam ho jayega. Us ne kaha: Mujhe Zughar ke chashme ke baare mein batao. Hum ne kaha: Tu kis cheez ke baare mein poochh raha hai? Us ne kaha: Kya chashme mein paani hai aur us ke log us ke paani se kheti karte hain? Hum ne kaha: Haan, us mein bohat paani hai aur us ke log us ke paani se kheti karte hain. Us ne kaha: Mujhe ummi nabi ke baare mein batao, unhon ne kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Wo Makkah se nikal kar Yathrib mein utar aaye. Us ne kaha: Kya Arab un se lade? Hum ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Unhon ne un ke saath kya kiya? Hum ne use bataya ke wo apne qareeb ke Arab par ghalib aa gaye aur unhon ne un ki itaat ki. Us ne kaha: Kya aisa hi hua? Hum ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Beshak ye un ke liye behtar hai ke wo un ki itaat karen. Aur main tumhein apne baare mein batata hun: Main masih hun, aur qareeb hai ke mujhe nikalne ki ijazat di jayegi; pas main nikalunga aur zameen mein chalunga, main kisi basti ko nahi chhodunga magar chalees raaton mein us mein utarunga, siwaye Makkah aur Taiba ke; ye donon mujh par haram hain. Jab bhi main in mein se kisi aik mein dakhil hona chahunga, mere saamne aik farishta nangi talwar ke saath aayega jo mujhe rok dega, aur un ke har darre par farishte nigrani karenge. Kya main tumhein na bataun? Ye Taiba hai, ye Taiba hai, ye Taiba hai. Kya main ne tumhein ye hadith nahi sunayi thi? Mujhe Tamim ki hadith pasand aayi ke wo us se milti hai jo main tumhein bata raha tha, aur Madinah aur Makkah ke baare mein bhi. Suno! Wo Sham ke samundar mein hai ya Yemen ke samundar mein; nahi, balke mashriq ki taraf se hai, wo mashriq ki taraf se hai, wo mashriq ki taraf se hai."
"7890","[AI-translation] Ae logon! Tum mein se koi kisi ko qatl na kare aur na kisi ko zakhm pahunche; aur jab tum jammara (kankari) maaro to khazaf ki kankariyon ki tarah maaro."
"7891","[AI-translation] ... Khare na ho yahan tak ke tum mujhe dekh lo."
"7892","[AI-translation] Ae Bilal! Namaz qaim karo, is se humein rahat do."
"7893","[AI-translation] Ae Bilal! Utho aur azaan do: jannat mein sirf momin hi dakhil hoga, aur beshak Allah is deen ko fajir aadmi ke zariye bhi madad deta hai."
"7894","[AI-translation] Ae Bilal! Tum kis amal ki wajah se mujh se pehle jannat mein dakhil ho gaye? Main jannat mein kabhi dakhil nahi hua magar main ne tumhare jooton ki khanak apne aage suni. Beshak main raat jannat mein dakhil hua aur main ne apne aage tumhare jooton ki khanak suni, phir main sone ka aik chaora-mukha buland mahal ke paas aaya. Main ne poocha: Ye mahal kis ka hai? Unhon ne kaha: Qureish ke aik aadmi ka. Main ne kaha: Main qureshi hun, ye mahal kis ka hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ki ummat ke aik aadmi ka. Main ne kaha: Main Muhammad hun, ye mahal kis ka hai? Unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ka."
"7895","[AI-translation] Ae Abu Umayya ki beti! Tum ne asr ke baad do rakaton ke baare mein poocha? Beshak mere paas Abdul Qais ke kuch log aaye aur unhon ne mujhe zohar ke baad ki do rakaton se mashghool kar diya, pas yehi wo do rakatein hain."
"7896","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Bayaza! Abu Hind se rishta karo aur use apni aurton se rishta do."
"7897","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Salama! Kya tum apne masjid tak ke qadmon ke ajr ka sawab nahi chahte?"
"7898","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Salama! Apne gharon mein raho, tumhare qadam likhe ja rahe hain."
"7899","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Abdul Muttalib! Tumhein siqaya ka haq hai; agar log is par tum se ghalib na aa jate to main khud zamzam se paani khinchta."
"7900","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Kisi ko na roko jo is ghar ka tawaf kare aur namaz parhe, raat ya din ki jis sa'at chahe."
"7901","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Main aik darane wala hun. Meri aur tumhari misal aise aadmi ki tarah hai jis ne dushman ko dekha aur apne ghar walon ki taraf rawana hua, phir dar gaya ke wo us se pehle us ke ghar walon tak na pahunch jayen, pas wo pukarne laga: Ya subahah! Ya subahah! Tum par hamla ho gaya, tum par hamla ho gaya."
"7902","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Fahr! Ae Bani Adi! Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Ae Bani Abdul Muttalib! Tumhara kya khayal, agar main tumhein bataun ke wadi mein ghoray hain jo tum par hamla karna chahte hain, kya tum mujhe sachcha maante? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne tumhein hamesha sachcha hi paya hai. Farmaya: To main tumhein aane wale sakht azab se darane wala hun."
"7903","[AI-translation] Ae Bani Ka'b bin Lu'ay! Apne aap ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Murra bin Ka'b! Apne aap ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Abd Shams! Apne aap ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Apne aap ko aag se bachao. Ae Bani Abdul Muttalib! Apne aap ko aag se bachao. Ae Fatima! Apne aap ko aag se bachao; kyunke main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta magar ye ke tumhara rishta hai jise main silla-e-reham se jodta rahunga."
"7904","[AI-translation] Ae Jabir! Jab izaar chaura ho to us ke donon kinaron ko mila do, aur jab tang ho to use apni kamar par mazboot baandh lo."
"7905","[AI-translation] Ae Jabir! Kya main tumhein khushkhabri na dun ke Allah ne tumhare baap se kya muamla kiya? Allah ne kabhi kisi se parda ke peechhe se hi kalam kiya, magar tumhare baap se roo-ba-roo kalam kiya aur farmaya: Ae mere bande! Mujh se koi tamanna kar, main tujhe dun. Us ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe zinda kar de taake main doosri martaba teri raah mein qatl hun. Rab tabarak wa taala ne farmaya: Beshak meri taraf se ye tay ho chuka hai ke wo maut ke baad us ki taraf wapas nahi aayenge. Us ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! To meri taraf se un logon ko pahuncha de jo mere peechhe hain."
"7906","[AI-translation] Ae Jarhad! Apni raan chhupa lo, kyunke raan satar hai."
"7907","[AI-translation] Ae Hazim! Kasrat se 'La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah' kaho, kyunke ye jannat ke khazanon mein se aik khazana hai."
"7908","[AI-translation] Ae Hassan! Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf se jawab do. Allahumma ayyidhu bi ruhil quds."
"7909","[AI-translation] Ae do kaanon wale!"
"7910","[AI-translation] Ae Ruwaifi! Shayad mere baad zindagi lambi hogi; pas logon ko bata do ke jo apni darhi ko girah lagaye ya gardan mein dori daale ya kisi janwar ki lat ya haddi se istinja kare, to beshak Muhammad us se bari-uz-zimma hai."
"7911","[AI-translation] Ae Saad! Teer chalao, mere baap aur maa tum par qurban hon."
"7912","[AI-translation] Ae Saad! Main aik aadmi ko deta hun aur doosra mujhe us se zyada pasand hota hai, is darr se ke Allah use munh ke bal aag mein na daal de."
"7913","[AI-translation] Ae do chhote jooton wale! Tera halak ho! Apne do joote utaar de."
"7914","[AI-translation] Ae Safiyya bint Abdul Muttalib! Ae Fatima bint Muhammad! Ae Bani Abdul Muttalib! Main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta; mere maal se jo chahe maang lo."
"7915","[AI-translation] Ae Aaish! Ye Jibril hain tumhein salaam kehte hain."
"7916","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Is ki shar se Allah ki panaah maango, kyunke yehi ghasiq hai jab wo dhalta hai - yani chand - ..."
"7917","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Kya tum ne ghaur kiya ke Allah ne mujhe us cheez ka jawab ata farmaya jis ke baare mein main ne us se poocha tha? Mere paas do aadmi aaye; aik mere sar ke paas baitha aur doosra mere pairon ke paas. Jis ne mere sar ke paas baith kar mere pairon wale se kaha: Is aadmi ko kya takleef hai? Us ne kaha: Is par jadu kiya gaya hai. Us ne kaha: Kis ne jadu kiya? Us ne kaha: Labid bin A'sam ne. Us ne kaha: Kis cheez mein? Us ne kaha: Kanghi aur kanghi ke baalon aur nar khajoor ke ghaab mein. Us ne kaha: Wo kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Zorwan ke kuwein mein. Ae Ayesha! Allah ki qasam, goya us ka paani mehndi ke rang ka geela tha aur us ke khajoor ke darakht shaitanon ke saron jaise the."
"7918","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Kya tumhare paas koi khel-tamasha nahi tha? Beshak Ansar khel-tamasha pasand karte hain."
"7919","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak Allah ne jannat ke liye aik ahl paida kiya, unhein jannat ke liye paida kiya jab wo apne baapon ki pushton mein the; aur dozakh ke liye aik ahl paida kiya, unhein dozakh ke liye paida kiya jab wo apne baapon ki pushton mein the."
"7920","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak Allah narm hai aur narmi ko pasand karta hai."
"7921","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak Allah narm hai, narmi ko pasand karta hai aur narmi par utna ata karta hai jitna sakhti par nahi deta aur na kisi aur cheez par deta hai."
"7922","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak Allah bad-zuban aur bad-zubani karne wale ko pasand nahi karta."
"7923","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak sab se bad-log wo hain jinhein log un ki burai se bachne ke liye izzat dete hain."
"7924","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak meri aankhein soti hain magar mera dil nahi sota."
"7925","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Beshak logon mein se sab se bura wo hai jise log us ki bad-zubani se bachne ke liye chhod dete hain."
"7926","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Ise mere paas se hata do, kyunke jab bhi main dakhil hota hun aur ise dekhta hun to mujhe duniya yaad aa jati hai."
"7927","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Allah se darne aur narmi ko laazim pakro, kyunke narmi jis cheez mein bhi rahi us ne use sajaya, aur jis cheez se bhi nikli us ne use bigaada."
"7928","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Agar tumhari qaum jahiliyyat ke qareeb ka zamana na hoti to main Baitullah ka hukm deta ke ise dhwa diya jaye, jo hissa is se nikala gaya use is mein dakhil kar diya jaye, ise zameen se mila diya jaye aur is ke do darwaze banaye jayen: aik mashriqi aur aik maghribi, taake ise Ibrahim ki bunyad tak pahuncha dun."
"7929","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Mujhe abhi tak Khaybar ke us khane ka dard mehsoos hota hai jo main ne khaya tha; ab wo waqt aa gaya hai ke main ne us zeher se apni shah rag ke katne ka ehsaas kiya."
"7930","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Mujhe kya amaan hai ke is mein azab na ho? Beshak aik qaum ko hawa se azab diya gaya, aur aik qaum ne azab dekha to kaha: 'Ye baadal hamare upar baarish barsane wala hai.'"
"7931","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Tum ne mujhe kabhi bad-zuban paya hai? Beshak qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek logon mein sab se bad-tareen wo hoga jise log us ki bad-zubani se bachne ke liye chhod dein."
"7932","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Gin-gin kar sadqa na do ke Allah bhi tumhare gunah ginne lage."
"7933","[AI-translation] Ae Ayesha! Bad-zuban na bano."
"7934","[AI-translation] Ae Allah ke bandon! Ilaaj karo, kyunke Allah ne koi beemari aisi nahi rakhi jis ka ilaaj nahi rakha, siwaye aik beemari ke: burhapa."
"7935","[AI-translation] Ae Allah ke bandon! Allah ne harj utha diya hai magar us ke liye jo kisi Musalman ki izzat par zulm se dast-e-daraz kare; wo hi halakat aur tangi mein mubtala hua."
"7936","[AI-translation] Ae Abbas! Kya tumhein Mughis ka Barira se mohabbat aur Barira ka Mughis se bughz taajjub mein nahi daalta?"
"7937","[AI-translation] Ae Abbas! Ae mere chacha! Kya main tumhein ata na karun? Kya main tumhein inaam na dun? Kya main tum par ehsan na karun? Kya main tumhare saath das khoobiyan na karun? Jab tum ye karoge to Allah tumhare gunah bakhsh dega: pehle aur aakhri, purane aur naye, bhool ke aur jaan-boojh ke, chhote aur bade, chhupe aur zahir. Das khoobiyan: Tum chaar rakatein parho, har rakat mein Fatiha aur aik surat padho. Jab pehli rakat mein padhna khatam karo aur tum khade ho to kaho: Subhanallah, walhamdulillah, wa la ilaha illallah, wallahu akbar - pandrah martaba. Phir ruku karo aur ruku ki halat mein das martaba kaho. Phir ruku se sar uthao aur das martaba kaho. Phir sajde mein jao aur sajde ki halat mein das martaba kaho. Phir sajde se sar uthao aur das martaba kaho. Phir sajda karo aur das martaba kaho. Phir sar uthao aur das martaba kaho. Is tarah har rakat mein pachattar martaba hoga. Ye chaar rakaton mein karo. Pas agar tumhare gunah samundar ki jhaag ya Ulaj ke ret ke barabar bhi hon to Allah unhein bakhsh dega. Agar tum ise har din aik martaba parh sakte ho to parho; agar na kar sako to har jumme aik martaba; agar na kar sako to har mahine aik martaba; agar na kar sako to har saal aik martaba; agar na kar sako to apni zindagi mein aik martaba."
"7938","[AI-translation] Ae Abbas! Ae Rasoolullah ke chacha! Allah se duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat maango."
"7939","[AI-translation] Ae Abdur Rahman! Apni behan ko le jao aur use Tan'eem se umrah karao."
"7940","[AI-translation] Ae Abdur Rahman! Apni behan Ayesha ko apne peechhe bithao aur use Tan'eem se umrah karao; pas jab tum use pahadi se utaro to use hukm do ke wo ihram bandhe, kyunke ye maqbool umrah hai."
"7941","[AI-translation] Ae Abdur Rahman bin Samura! Amarat ka sawal na karo; kyunke agar tumhein ye maangne se mil jaye to tum is ke supurd kar diye jaoge, aur agar bina maangne ke mile to tumhari madad ki jayegi. Aur jab tum kisi baat ki qasam khao aur us ke siwa ko behtar dekho to apni qasam ka kaffara do aur us ko ikhtiyar karo jo behtar hai."
"7942","[AI-translation] Ae Abdullah! Kya mujhe khabar nahi di gayi ke tum din ko roze rakhte ho aur raat ko qiyam karte ho? Aisa na karo, kyunke jab tum aisa karoge to tumhari aankhein dhans jayengi aur tumhari jaan thak jayegi; pas roza bhi rakho aur iftar bhi karo, qiyam bhi karo aur so bhi jao; kyunke tumhare jism ka tum par haq hai, tumhari aankhon ka tum par haq hai aur tumhari biwi ka tum par haq hai. Aur tumhare liye ye kafi hai ke har mahine teen din roze rakho, kyunke har neki ke badle das guna ajr hai; pas ye poore zamane ke roze hain. Us ne kaha: Main is se zyada taaqat rakhta hun. Farmaya: To nabi Dawud alaihis salam ki tarah roze rakho aur us se zyada na badho; wo aadha zamana hai."
"7943","[AI-translation] Ae Abdullah! Agar Allah tumhein jannat mein dakhil karega to ye sab tumhara hoga aur jo tumhari jaan chahegi aur tumhari aankhein lutf utahengi."
"7944","[AI-translation] Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Kya main tumhein aik aisa kalima na bataun jo jannat ke khazanon mein se aik khazana hai? 'La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah'."
"7945","[AI-translation] Ae Abdullah! Fulan ki tarah na ho; wo raat ko qiyam karta tha phir raat ke qiyam ko chhod diya."
"7946","[AI-translation] Ae Usman! Kya tum meri sunnat se raghbat nahi rakhte? Beshak main sota bhi hun, namaz bhi parhta hun, roza bhi rakhta hun, iftar bhi karta hun aur aurton se nikah bhi karta hun. Pas Allah se daro ae Usman! Beshak tumhare ghar walon ka tum par haq hai, tumhare mehman ka tum par haq hai aur tumhari jaan ka tum par haq hai; pas roza rakho aur iftar karo, namaz parho aur so jao."
"7947","[AI-translation] Ae Usman! Allah tumhein aik qamees pehnayega; pas agar munafiq tum se use utaarne ka irada karen to tum use na utaarna yahan tak ke mujh se milo."
"7948","[AI-translation] Ae Uqba! Kya main tumhein behtar do suraton ki taleem na dun jo padhi gayi hain? 'Qul a'uzu bi rabbil falaq' aur 'Qul a'uzu bi rabbin nas'. Ae Uqba! Inhein padho jab bhi tum so jao aur utho; kisi sawal karne wale ne in jaisi cheez ka sawal nahi kiya aur na kisi panaah maangne wale ne in jaisi cheez ki panaah maangi."
"7949","[AI-translation] Ae Uqba bin Aamir! Inhi ke zariye panaah maango, kyunke kisi panaah maangne wale ne in jaisi cheez ki panaah nahi maangi."
"7950","[AI-translation] Ae Uqba! 'Qul huwallahu ahad', 'Qul a'uzu bi rabbil falaq' aur 'Qul a'uzu bi rabbin nas' - kisi ne in jaisi cheez ki panaah nahi maangi."
"7951","[AI-translation] Ae Ali! Kya tum raazi nahi hote ke tum mere liye aise ho jaise Harun Musa ke liye the? Magar ye ke mere baad koi nabi nahi."
"7952","[AI-translation] Ae Ali! Allah se hidaayat aur istaqamat maango; aur hidaayat se apne raaste ki hidaayat aur istaqamat se teer ka seedha hona yaad rakho."
"7953","[AI-translation] Ae Ali! Aik nazar ke baad doosri nazar na daalo; kyunke pehli nazar tumhare liye hai aur aakhri tumhare liye nahi."
"7954","[AI-translation] Ae Ali! Kuttay ki tarah kamar ke bal na baitho."
"7955","[AI-translation] Ae mere chacha! Kya main tumhein sila-e-reham na dun? Kya main tumhein apna dost na banaun? Kya main tumhein nafa na pahunchaun? Ae chacha! Tum chaar rakatein parho, har rakat mein Fatiha aur aik surat. Pas jab qirat khatam ho to ruku se pehle pandrah martaba kaho: Allahu akbar, walhamdulillah, wa subhanallah, wa la ilaha illallah. Phir ruku karo aur sar uthane se pehle das martaba kaho. Phir sar uthao aur sajde se pehle das martaba kaho. Phir sajda karo aur sar uthane se pehle das martaba kaho. Phir sar uthao aur das martaba kaho. Phir sajda karo aur das martaba kaho. Phir utho aur khade hone se pehle das martaba kaho. Is tarah har rakat mein pachattar aur chaar rakaton mein teen sau honge. Pas agar tumhare gunah samundar ki jhaag ya Ulaj ke ret ke barabar hon to Allah unhein bakhsh dega. Agar har din na parh sako to har jumme parho, agar na sako to har mahine, agar na sako to har saal."
"7956","[AI-translation] Ae Awf! Qayamat se pehle chhe cheezon ko yaad rakhna: un mein se aik meri maut hai; phir Bait-ul-Maqdis ki fatah; phir aik beemari jo tum mein zahir hogi jis se Allah tumhari aulad aur tumhari jaanein shaheed karega aur us se tumhare maal paak karega; phir maal tum mein itna hoga ke aik aadmi ko sau dinare diye jayenge aur wo phir bhi naraaz rahega; phir aik fitna jo tum mein hoga, koi Musalman ghar aisa nahi bachega jis mein wo dakhil na ho; phir tumhare aur Bani Asfar ke darmiyan sulah hogi, wo dhoka denge aur assi jhandon ke saath tum par chadhai karenge, har jhande ke neeche bara hazaar honge."
"7957","[AI-translation] Ae ladke! Main tumhein kuch kalimat sikha raha hun: Allah ko yaad rakho, wo tumhein yaad rakhega. Allah ko yaad rakho, tum use apne saamne paoge. Jab maango to Allah se maango, aur jab madad chaaho to Allah se madad chaaho. Aur jaan lo ke agar poori ummat tumhein kisi nafa par ikatthi ho jaye to wo tumhein utna hi nafa de sakti hai jitna Allah ne tumhare liye likha hai; aur agar wo sab tumhein nuqsan pahunchane par ikatthe ho jayen to utna hi nuqsan pahuncha sakti hai jitna Allah ne tum par likha hai. Qalamein khooshk ho gayin aur sahife utha liye gaye."
"7958","[AI-translation] Ae ladke! Bismillah kaho, apne daayein haath se khao aur apne aage se khao."
"7959","[AI-translation] Ae ladke! Ye tumhare baap hain aur ye tumhari maa; in donon mein se jise chaaho uska haath pakad lo."
"7960","[AI-translation] Ae Fatima! Us ka sar mundaao aur us ke baalon ke wazan ke barabar chandi sadqa karo."
"7961","[AI-translation] Ae Fatima! Kya tum raazi nahi ke tum momin aurton ki sardar ho?"
"7962","[AI-translation] Ae Fatima! Kya tumhein ye pasand hoga ke log kahen: Fatima bint Muhammad ke haath mein aag ki zanjeer hai?!"
"7963","[AI-translation] Ae Fulan! Tumhein kaunsi cheez zyada aziz hai: ye ke apni umar bhar duniya ka lutf uthao, ya ye ke kal jannat ke darwazon mein se jis darwaze par bhi aao to use tumhare liye khola hua pao?"
"7964","[AI-translation] Ae Fulan! Kya tum apni namaz achhi nahi parhte? Kya namaz parhne wala nahi dekhta ke jab wo namaz parhta hai to kaise parhta hai? Wo to apne liye hi namaz parhta hai. Allah ki qasam, main apne peechhe se bhi utna hi dekhta hun jitna apne aage se."
"7965","[AI-translation] Ae Qabisa! Sawal sirf teen logon ke liye halal hai: aik wo aadmi jis ne kisi ke liye zimmedari utha li ho, pas us ke liye maangna halal hai yahan tak ke wo use pura kar le phir ruk jaye; aur aik wo aadmi jise koi aafat aa kar us ka maal le do, pas us ke liye maangna halal hai yahan tak ke wo guzara kar sake; aur aik wo aadmi jise sakht faqr aa jaye yahan tak ke us ki qaum ke teen samajhdaar log kahen: Fulan ko sakht faqr ne aa liya hai, pas us ke liye maangna halal hai yahan tak ke wo guzara kar sake phir ruk jaye. Pas in ke siwa jo maangna hai wo sawal karne wale ke liye haram hai, wo use haram khata hai."
"7966","[AI-translation] Ae Muaz! Kya tum fitna karne wale ho? Kyun na tum 'Sabbihisma rabbikal a'la', 'Wash-shamsi wa duhaha' aur 'Wal-laili iza yaghsha' parh kar namaz parhate? Kyunke tumhare peechhe boodhe, kamzor aur hajat-mand log namaz parhte hain."
"7967","[AI-translation] Ae Muaz bin Jabal! Jo bhi dil se sachcha hokar gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun, Allah use aag par haram kar deta hai. Us ne kaha: Ae Rasoolullah! Kya main logon ko na bata dun taake wo khush ho jayen? Farmaya: Tab wo bharosa kar ke baith jayenge."
"7968","[AI-translation] Ae Muaz bin Jabal! Kya tum jaante ho Allah ka apne bandon par kya haq hai aur bandon ka Allah par kya haq hai? Beshak Allah ka bandon par haq ye hai ke wo us ki ibadat karen aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karen; aur bandon ka Allah par haq ye hai ke wo use azab na de jo us ke saath kisi ko shareek na kare."
"7969","[AI-translation] Ae Muaz! Allah ki qasam, main tum se mohabbat karta hun. Ae Muaz! Main tumhein wasiyat karta hun: har namaz ke baad ye kahna kabhi na chhodo: Allahumma a'inni ala zikrika wa shukrika wa husni ibadatik."
"7970","[AI-translation] Ae Ansar ki jamaat! Kya main ne tumhein gumrahi mein nahi paya aur Allah ne mere zariye tumhein hidaayat di; tum muntashir the aur Allah ne mere zariye tumhein joda; tum muhtaaj the aur Allah ne mere zariye tumhein ghani kiya. Kya tum raazi nahi hote ke log bakri aur oont le jayen aur tum Rasoolullah ko apne gharon mein le jao? Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar ka aik aadmi hota; agar log aik wadi aur ghaati mein chalte to main Ansar ki wadi aur ghaati mein chalta. Ansar mera shi'ar hain aur log daas hain. Beshak tum par mere baad eesar ki jayegi; pas sabr karo yahan tak ke tum mujh se Hoz-e-Kausar par milo."
"7971","[AI-translation] Ae Ansar ki jamaat! Apne maal apne paas rakho, unhein kisi ko zindagi bhar ke liye na do; kyunke jo kisi ko zindagi bhar ke liye koi cheez de de to wo us ki zindagi mein bhi us ki hai aur us ki maut ke baad bhi."
"7972","[AI-translation] Ae Ansar ki jamaat! Mujhe tumhare baare mein kya hadith pahunchi hai? Kya tum raazi nahi hote ke log maal le jayen aur tum Rasoolullah ko le jao yahan tak ke unhein apne gharon mein dakhil karo? Agar log aik ghaati ikhtiyar karte aur Ansar aik ghaati ikhtiyar karte to main Ansar ki ghaati ikhtiyar karta."
"7973","[AI-translation] Ae tijarat karne walo! Beshak shaitan aur gunah kharid-o-farokht mein hazir hote hain; pas apni bikri mein sadqa mila do."
"7974","[AI-translation] Ae tijarat karne walo! Beshak is bikri mein laghw aur qasmein hazir hoti hain; pas ise sadqe se mila do."
"7975","[AI-translation] Ae naujawanon ki jamaat! Tum mein se jo nikah ki taaqat rakhta ho wo nikah kar le, kyunke ye nazar ko neechi rakhta hai aur sharmgah ko mehfooz rakhta hai; aur jo taaqat na rakhe wo roze rakhe, kyunke roza us ke liye dhhaal hai."
"7976","[AI-translation] Ae faqiron ki jamaat! Kya main tumhein khushkhabri na dun? Beshak momin faqir apne ghani logon se aadha din pehle jannat mein dakhil honge: pandrah sau saal."
"7977","[AI-translation] Ae Musalmano ki jamaat! Us ki namaz nahi jo ruku aur sajde mein apni peeth seedhi na kare."
"7978","[AI-translation] Ae Muhajiron ki jamaat! Paanch aadat hain; agar tum un mein mubtala ho jao to main Allah ki panaah maangta hun ke tum unhein paa lo: Jab kisi qaum mein be-hayai zahir hui aur unhon ne us ka elaan kiya to un mein taoon aur aise dard phail gaye jo un ke guzre hue baapon mein nahi the. Aur unhon ne naap-taul mein kami nahi ki magar qehat, sakht kharchi aur hukmaranon ke zulm mein pakde gaye. Aur unhon ne apne maalon ki zakaat nahi roki magar aasman se barish rok li gayi; aur agar janwar na hote to un par barish na hoti. Aur unhon ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ke ahad ko nahi toda magar Allah ne un par un ke ghair mein se dushman musallat kiya aur un ke haathon se kuch cheezein chhin lin. Aur jab tak un ke imamon ne Allah azza wa jall ki kitab se faisla nahi kiya aur Allah ne jo utara hai us ke mutabiq nahi chala, Allah ne un ke darmiyan jhagda daal diya."
"7979","[AI-translation] Ae Muhajir o Ansar ki jamaat! Beshak tumhare bhaiyon mein aise log hain jin ke paas na maal hai na kunba; pas tum mein se har aik do ya teen aadmiyon ko apne saath mila le."
"7980","[AI-translation] Ae aurton ki jamaat! Sadqa karo aur kasrat se istighfar karo, kyunke main ne tumhein dozakh walon mein zyada dekha hai. Tum kasrat se laanat karti ho aur shohar ki nashukri karti ho. Main ne aql aur deen mein naqis aurton se zyada aql-mand aadmi ko maghloob hote nahi dekha. Aql ki kami ye hai ke do aurton ki gawahi aik mard ki gawahi ke barabar hai, ye aql ki kami hai; aur wo kai raatein namaz parhe baghair guzarti hain aur Ramazan mein iftar karti hai, ye deen ki kami hai."
"7981","[AI-translation] Ae aurton ki jamaat! Sadqa karo chahe apne zewar se, kyunke qayamat ke din tum jahannam walon mein zyada hoge."
"7982","[AI-translation] Ae Qureish ki jamaat! Apne aap ko Allah se kharido; main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare kisi kaam nahi aa sakta. Ae Bani Abd Manaf! Apne aap ko Allah se kharido; main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare kisi kaam nahi aa sakta. Ae Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib! Main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare kuch kaam nahi aa sakta. Ae Safiyya Rasoolullah ki phuphi! Main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare kuch kaam nahi aa sakta. Ae Fatima bint Muhammad! Tum mere maal se jo chaaho maang lo, main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare kuch kaam nahi aa sakta."
"7983","[AI-translation] Ae Qureish ki jamaat! Apne aap ko aag se bachao; kyunke main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare liye na nuqsan ka ikhtiyar rakhta hun na nafa ka. Ae Bani Abd Manaf ki jamaat! Apne aap ko aag se bachao; kyunke main Allah ke muamle mein tumhare liye na nuqsan ka ikhtiyar rakhta hun na nafa ka. Ae Bani Abdul Muttalib ki jamaat! Apne aap ko aag se bachao; kyunke main tumhare liye na nuqsan ka ikhtiyar rakhta hun na nafa ka. Ae Fatima bint Muhammad! Apne aap ko aag se bachao; kyunke main tumhare liye na nuqsan ka ikhtiyar rakhta hun na nafa ka. Beshak tumhara rishta hai jise main silla-e-reham se jodta rahunga."
"7984","[AI-translation] Ae un logon ki jamaat jo zaban se iman laye aur iman un ke dil mein nahi gaya! Musalmanon ki gheebat na karo aur un ke aibon ki talaash na karo; kyunke jo apne Musalman bhai ke aib ki talaash karega Allah us ke aib ki talaash karega, aur jis ke aib Allah talaash karega use ruswa kar dega chahe wo apne ghar ke andar ho."
"7985","[AI-translation] Ae un logon ki jamaat jo zaban se musalman hue aur iman un ke dil mein nahi aaya! Musalmanon ko takleef na do, unhein aib na lagao aur un ke aibon ki talaash na karo; kyunke jo apne Musalman bhai ke aib ki talaash karega Allah us ke aib ki talaash karega, aur jis ke aib Allah talaash karega use ruswa kar dega chahe wo apne sawari ke andar ho."
"7986","[AI-translation] Ae Yahud ki jamaat! Islam lao, salaamat pao. Jaan lo ke zameen Allah aur us ke Rasool ki hai, aur main tumhein is zameen se nikalna chahta hun; pas tum mein se jo apne maal ka koi hissa paaye wo use bech de, warna jaan lo ke zameen Allah aur us ke Rasool ki hai."
"7987","[AI-translation] Ae dilon ko pherne wale! Mere dil ko apne deen par saabit rakh."
"7988","[AI-translation] Ae dilon ko pherne wale! Humare dilon ko apne deen par saabit rakh."
"7989","[AI-translation] Ae Musalman aurton! Koi hamsina apni hamsina ko haqeer na samjhe, chahe bakri ka suma ho."
"7990","[AI-translation] Ae Huzal! Agar tum ne ise apne kapde se chhupa liya hota to tumhare liye behtar hota."
"7991","[AI-translation] Dajjal Madina aayega aur farishton ko use nigrani karte payega; pas na Dajjal us mein dakhil hoga na taoon, agar Allah taala chahe."
"7992","[AI-translation] Dajjal aayega aur us par Madina ke darron mein dakhil hona haram hai; wo Madina ki kuch shor-zameen mein utrega. Us din ek aadmi us ki taraf niklega jo logon mein behtar ya behtareen logon mein se hoga, wo kahega: Main gawahi deta hun ke tu wohi Dajjal hai jis ka tazkira Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se kiya tha. Dajjal kahega: Tumhara kya khayal, agar main ise qatl kar dun phir zinda kar dun, kya tum is maamle mein shak karoge? Wo kahenge: Nahi. Pas wo use qatl karega phir zinda karega. Jab wo use zinda karega to wo kahega: Allah ki qasam, aaj se pehle main tujhe kabhi itna na pehchanta tha jitna aaj pehchanta hun. Phir Dajjal use qatl karna chahega magar us par qaboo na pa sakega."
"7993","[AI-translation] Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Ye kis ne paida kiya? Ye kis ne paida kiya? Yahan tak ke wo kahe: Tumhare Rab ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jab use ye maqam pahunch jaye to wo Allah ki panaah maange aur ruk jaye."
"7994","[AI-translation] Quran aur us ke ahl, jo duniya mein us par amal karte the, qayamat ke din aayenge; un ke aage Surah Baqarah aur Aal-e-Imran hongi, donon aayengi goya do baadal hain ya do kale baadal hain ya do saaye hain chidiyaon ke paron ki tarah, apne saathi ki taraf se jhagadte hue."
"7995","[AI-translation] Masih mashriq ki taraf se aayega aur uska rukh Madina hoga yahan tak ke wo Uhud ke peechhe utrega; phir farishte uska munh Sham ki taraf pher denge aur wahin wo halak hoga."
"7996","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-jannat mein se aik aadmi ko qayamat ke din laaya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Ae ibn Adam! Apna maqam kaisa paya? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Behtareen maqam. Farmaya: Maango aur tamanna karo. Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Main kuch maangta ya tamanna nahi karta magar ye ke tum mujhe duniya mein wapas bhej do taake main teri raah mein das martaba qatl hun; ye shaheedgi ki fazilat dekhne ki wajah se hoga. Aur ahl-e-dozakh mein se aik aadmi ko laaya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Ae ibn Adam! Apna maqam kaisa paya? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Bura maqam. Us se kaha jayega: Kya tum is se zameen bhar sona de kar chhutkara chahte ho? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Haan. Farmaya: Tum ne jhoot kaha; main ne tum se is se kam aur aasan cheez maangi thi magar tum ne nahi ki. Pas wo dozakh mein wapas dhakel diya jayega."
"7997","[AI-translation] Bande ko qayamat ke din laaya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Kya main ne tumhein kaan, aankh, maal aur aulad nahi di? Aur tumhare liye janwar aur kheti kariyam nahi ki? Aur tumhein sardar aur mutawallit chhor diya? Kya tum samajhte the ke tum apne is din se miloge? Wo kahega: Nahi. To us se kaha jayega: Aaj main tumhein bhool jata hun jaise tum mujhe bhool gaye the."
"7998","[AI-translation] Maut ko laaya jayega goya aik chitraila mendha ho, yahan tak ke jannat aur dozakh ke darmiyan ki deewar par khada kiya jayega. Kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo! To wo gardan lambi karenge. Kaha jayega: Ae dozakh walo! To wo gardan lambi karenge. Phir kaha jayega: Kya tum ise pehchante ho? Wo kahenge: Haan, ye maut hai. Pas wo litaya jayega aur zibah kar diya jayega. Agar Allah ne ahl-e-jannat ke liye hamesha ki zindagi aur baqaa ka faisla na kar diya hota to wo khushi se mar jate, aur agar Allah ne ahl-e-dozakh ke liye wahan hamesha ki zindagi ka faisla na kar diya hota to wo gham se mar jate."
"7999","[AI-translation] Maut ko qayamat ke din laaya jayega aur pul-sirat par khada kiya jayega. Kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo! Pas wo apni jagah se nikalne ke darr se khauf-zada hokar jhankenge. Phir kaha jayega: Ae dozakh walo! Pas wo apni jagah se nikalne ki khushi mein jhankenge. Phir kaha jayega: Kya tum ise pehchante ho? Wo kahenge: Haan, ye maut hai. Pas us ka hukm diya jayega aur wo pul-sirat par zibah kar di jayegi. Phir donon giroh se kaha jayega: Ab hamesha raho us halat mein jis mein tum ho, yahan koi maut nahi aayegi."
"8000","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-dozakh mein se duniya ke sab se zyada naimat mein rehne wale aadmi ko qayamat ke din laaya jayega aur use jahannam mein aik martaba duboya jayega, phir us se kaha jayega: Ae ibn Adam! Kya tum ne kabhi koi khushi dekhi? Kya tum par kabhi koi naimat guzri? Wo kahega: Nahi, Allah ki qasam ae mere Rab! Aur ahl-e-jannat mein se duniya ke sab se zyada takleef mein rehne wale aadmi ko laaya jayega aur use jannat mein aik martaba duboya jayega, phir us se kaha jayega: Ae ibn Adam! Kya tum ne kabhi koi takleef dekhi? Kya tum par kabhi koi shiddat guzri? Wo kahega: Nahi, Allah ki qasam ae mere Rab! Mujh par kabhi koi takleef nahi guzri aur main ne kabhi koi shiddat nahi dekhi."
"8001","[AI-translation] Us din jahannam ko laaya jayega, us ke sattar hazaar lagam honge; har lagam ke saath sattar hazaar farishte honge jo use kheench rahe honge."
"8002","[AI-translation] Logon par aisa zamana aayega jis mein un ka apne deen par sabr karna angoothi par rakhne wale ki tarah hoga."
"8003","[AI-translation] Logon par aisa zamana aayega jis mein aadmi parwah nahi karega ke us ne maal kahan se kamaya, halal se ya haram se."
"8004","[AI-translation] Logon par aisa zamana aayega jab aadmi apne chacha-zad bhai aur rishtedar ko bulayega: Aao khushhali ki taraf, aao khushhali ki taraf. Aur Madina un ke liye behtar hota agar wo jaante. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, un mein se koi is se raghbat kar ke nahi nikalega magar Allah us mein us se behtar log badal dega. Suno! Madina bhatti ki tarah hai jo mail nikal deti hai. Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Madina apne bad-logon ko door kar de jaise bhatti lohe ki mail ko door karti hai."
"8005","[AI-translation] Logon par aisa zamana aayega jab logon ki aik jamaat jihad karegi, to un se kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka sahabi hai? Wo kahenge: Haan; pas un ke liye fatah di jayegi. Phir logon par aisa zamana aayega jab logon ki aik jamaat jihad karegi to un se kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi sahaba ke saathi hain? Wo kahenge: Haan; pas un ke liye fatah di jayegi. Phir logon par aisa zamana aayega jab logon ki aik jamaat jihad karegi to un se kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi un logon ka saathi hai jo sahaba ke saathi the? Wo kahenge: Haan; pas un ke liye fatah di jayegi."
"8006","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein aise log aayenge jinke daant chhote honge aur aql halki hogi; wo makhluq ke behtareen qaul ki baat karenge magar Islam se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai; un ka iman un ke galon se aage nahi jayega. Pas unhein qatl karo, kyunke unhein qatl karne wale ke liye qayamat ke din ajr hai."
"8007","[AI-translation] Aadmi ko us ke tamam kharche ka ajr milega siwaye mitti ke."
"8008","[AI-translation] Mukatib apne hisse ke mutabiq ada karta hai; jitna ada kar diya wo azaad aadmi ki diyat ke barabar hai aur jo baqi raha wo ghulam ki diyat ke barabar hai."
"8009","[AI-translation] Jabbar apne aasman aur zameen ko apne haath mein lega, phir farmayega: Main Jabbar hun, main Malik hun; kahan hain jabbar? Kahan hain takabbur karne wale?"
"8010","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-jannat jannat mein khayenge aur piyenge, na nakhra nikalenge, na paakhana karenge, na peshab karenge; un ka khana sirf dakar aur pasina hoga misk ki khushbu jaise. Unhein tasbeeh aur tahmeed aise ilham ki jayegi jaise saans lena."
"8011","[AI-translation] Logon ki imamat wo karega jo Allah ki kitab ka sab se zyada qari ho; agar qirat mein barabar hon to jo sunnat ka zyada jaanne wala ho; agar sunnat mein barabar hon to jis ne hijrat pehle ki ho; agar hijrat mein barabar hon to jo umar mein bada ho. Aur koi aadmi kisi ke ghar mein aur na us ke ikhtiyar ke maqam par us ki ijazat ke baghair imamat na karaye, aur na us ke ghar mein us ke samman par baithe magar us ki ijazat se."
"8012","[AI-translation] Logon ki imamat un mein se Quran ka sab se zyada qari karega."
"8013","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki aankh mein tanak dekhta hai aur apni aankh ke shahbal ko bhool jata hai."
"8014","[AI-translation] Logon ko un ki niyyaton ke mutabiq uthaya jayega."
"8015","[AI-translation] Har banda isi halat par uthaya jayega jis par wo mara."
"8016","[AI-translation] Dajjal ki pairwi Asbahan ke yahudiyon mein se sattar hazaar karenge, un par taiylasan hongi."
"8017","[AI-translation] Maut ke peechhe teen cheezein jayengi: us ke ghar wale, us ka amal aur us ka maal; pas do laut jayenge aur aik rah jayega: us ke ghar wale aur maal laut jayenge aur us ka amal rah jayega."
"8018","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din humara Rab hum par hans kar tajalli farmayega."
"8019","[AI-translation] Tum mein raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte baari baari aate hain aur fajr aur asr ki namaz mein ikatthe hote hain; phir jo raat tum mein guzarte hain wo upar chadhte hain aur un se poocha jata hai, halanke wo un se zyada jaanta hai: Tum ne mere bandon ko kis halat mein chhoda? Wo kahenge: Hum ne unhein namaz parhte chhoda aur hum un ke paas namaz parhte hue aaye."
"8020","[AI-translation] Zamana qareeb ho jayega, ilm utha liya jayega, bukhl daal diya jayega, fitne zahir honge aur harj zyada hoga. Poocha gaya: Harj kya hai? Farmaya: Qatl."
"8021","[AI-translation] Humara Rab tabarak wa taala har raat aasman-e-duniya par utarta hai jab raat ka aakhri tihai baqi reh jata hai, phir farmata hai: Kaun hai jo mujhe pukare to main us ki dua qabool karun? Kaun hai jo mujh se maange to main use dun? Kaun hai jo mujh se bakhshish maange to main use bakhsh dun?"
"8022","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din aik aadmi ko laaya jayega aur dozakh mein daal diya jayega; us ki antariyan bahar nikal aayengi aur wo dozakh mein unhein le kar aise ghumega jaise gadha apni chakki ke gird ghumta hai. Ahl-e-dozakh us ke ird-gird jama honge aur kahenge: Ae Fulan! Tumhein kya hua? Kya tum humein neki ka hukm nahi dete the aur burai se nahi rokate the? Wo kahega: Haan, main tumhein neki ka hukm deta tha magar khud nahi karta tha, aur burai se rokta tha magar khud karta tha."
"8023","[AI-translation] Jamaat ke guzarne par un mein se aik ka salaam karna kafi hai, aur baithne walon ki taraf se aik ka jawab dena kafi hai."
"8024","[AI-translation] Wuzu ke liye aik mud kafi hai aur ghusl ke liye aik sa kafi hai."
"8025","[AI-translation] Allah qayamat ke din logon ko aik medaan mein jama karega, phir Rab-ul-Aalameen un par tajalli farmayega aur farmayega: Har insan apne us mabood ke peechhe chala jaye jis ki wo ibadat karta tha. Pas saleeb wale ke liye us ka saleeb, murti wale ke liye us ki murti aur aag wale ke liye us ki aag pesh ki jayegi; wo apne maboodon ke peechhe chale jayenge. Aur Musalman baqi rahenge, phir Rab-ul-Aalameen un par tajalli farmayega aur farmayega: Tum logon ke peechhe kyun nahi chale? Wo kahenge: Hum tujh se Allah ki panaah maangte hain, hum tujh se Allah ki panaah maangte hain; Allah humara Rab hai aur ye humara maqam hai yahan tak ke hum apne Rab ko dekhein. Wo unhein hukm dega aur unhein sabit rakhega. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasoolullah! Kya hum use dekhenge? Farmaya: Kya badri raat ke chand ko dekhne mein tumhein koi takleef hoti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Farmaya: To us waqt tumhein us ke deedar mein bhi koi takleef nahi hogi. Phir wo chhup jayega aur phir tajalli farmayega aur unhein apni pehchaan karayega, phir farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun, meri pairwi karo. Pas Musalman khade honge aur pul-sirat rakha jayega; wo us par jaise behtareen ghode aur sawariyan guzrenge aur un ka qaul hoga: Salamati, salamati. Aur ahl-e-dozakh baqi rahenge, un mein se aik giroh dozakh mein daala jayega. Phir poocha jayega: Kya bhar gayi? Wo kahegi: Kya kuch aur hai? Phir aik aur giroh daala jayega aur poocha jayega: Kya bhar gayi? Wo kahegi: Kya kuch aur hai? Yahan tak ke jab wo unhein poori tarah bhar legi, Rahman apna qadam us mein rakh dega aur us ke kuch hisse ko kuch hisse se mila dega, phir farmayega: Bas? Wo kahegi: Bas, bas. Pas jab Allah ahl-e-jannat ko jannat mein aur ahl-e-dozakh ko dozakh mein dakhil kar dega to maut ko ghaseette hue laaya jayega aur jannat aur dozakh walon ke darmiyan ki deewar par khada kiya jayega. Phir kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo! Pas wo darr kar jhankenge. Phir kaha jayega: Ae dozakh walo! Pas wo shafaat ki umeed mein khush hokar jhankenge. Phir jannat aur dozakh walon se kaha jayega: Kya tum ise pehchante ho? Ye donon giroh kahenge: Hum ne ise pehchan liya, ye maut hai jo hum par muqarrar ki gayi thi. Pas wo litaya jayega aur deewar par zibah kar diya jayega. Phir kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo! Hamesha raho, koi maut nahi; aur ae dozakh walo! Hamesha raho, koi maut nahi."
"8026","[AI-translation] Momin qayamat ke din ikatthe honge aur is se ghabra jayenge, pas kahenge: Kaash hum apne Rab ke paas kisi ki shafaat lete jo humein is maqam se rahat de. Pas wo Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Adam! Tum insaniyat ke baap ho; Allah ne tumhein apne haath se paida kiya, apne farishton ko tumhein sajda karaya aur tumhein har cheez ke naam sikhaye; hamari shafaat apne Rab ke paas karo taake wo humein is maqam se rahat de. Adam un se kahenge: Main is maqam wala nahi hun; aur apna wo gunah yaad karenge jo un se hua tha aur is se apne Rab azza wa jall se sharmayenge, aur kahenge: Lekin Nuh ke paas jao, kyunke wo pehle Rasool hain jinhein Allah ne zameen walon ki taraf bheja. Pas wo Nuh ke paas aayenge; wo kahenge: Main is maqam wala nahi hun; aur unhein apni wo khata yaad dilayenge ke unhon ne apne Rab se aisi cheez maangi jis ka unhein ilm nahi tha, aur is se apne Rab se sharmayenge; lekin Ibrahim Khalil-ur-Rahman ke paas jao. Pas wo un ke paas aayenge; wo kahenge: Main is maqam wala nahi hun, lekin Musa ke paas jao jo Allah ka banda hain jis se Allah ne kalam kiya aur use Taurat di. Pas wo Musa ke paas aayenge; wo kahenge: Main is maqam wala nahi hun; aur unhein wo jaan yaad dilayenge jo unhon ne baghair qatl ke qatl ki thi, aur is se apne Rab se sharmayenge; lekin Isa Abdullah aur us ke Rasool, us ke kalima aur us ki rooh ke paas jao. Pas wo Isa ke paas aayenge; wo un se kahenge: Main is maqam wala nahi hun, lekin Muhammad ke paas jao, wo Allah ka banda hain jis ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh diye gaye. Pas main uthunga aur mominon ki do satahon ke darmiyan chalunga yahan tak ke apne Rab se ijazat maangunga; mujhe ijazat di jayegi. Jab main apne Rab ko dekhunga to apne Rab tabarak wa taala ke liye sajde mein gir jaunga; wo mujhe jitna chahega sajde mein rehne dega, phir farmayega: Muhammad! Sar uthao, kaho to suna jayega, maango to diya jayega, shafaat karo to qabool hogi. Pas main apna sar uthaunga aur us ki tareef us tareef se karunga jo wo mujhe sikhayega; phir shafaat karunga aur mujhe aik hadd muqarrar kar di jayegi, pas main unhein jannat mein dakhil karunga. Phir doosri martaba us ke paas jaunga; jab apne Rab ko dekhunga to sajde mein gir jaunga; wo mujhe jitna chahega sajde mein rehne dega, phir farmayega: Muhammad! Sar uthao, kaho to suna jayega, maango to diya jayega, shafaat karo to qabool hogi. Main apna sar uthaunga aur us ki tareef us tareef se karunga jo wo mujhe sikhayega; phir shafaat karunga aur mujhe aik hadd muqarrar kar di jayegi, pas main unhein jannat mein dakhil karunga. Phir teesri martaba us ke paas jaunga; jab apne Rab tabarak wa taala ko dekhunga to sajde mein gir jaunga; wo mujhe jitna chahega sajde mein rehne dega, phir farmayega: Muhammad! Sar uthao, kaho to suna jayega, maango to diya jayega, shafaat karo to qabool hogi. Jab main apna sar uthaunga to us ki tareef us tareef se karunga jo wo mujhe sikhayega, phir shafaat karunga aur mujhe aik hadd muqarrar kar di jayegi, pas main unhein jannat mein dakhil karunga. Phir chauthi martaba jaunga aur kahunga: Ae mere Rab! Ab sirf wo hi baqi hain jinhein Quran ne roka hai. Pas jo 'La ilaha illallah' kahe aur us ke dil mein jau ke dane ke barabar khair ho wo dozakh se nikal aayega; phir jo 'La ilaha illallah' kahe aur us ke dil mein gehon ke dane ke barabar khair ho wo dozakh se nikal aayega; phir jo 'La ilaha illallah' kahe aur us ke dil mein zarra ke barabar khair ho wo dozakh se nikal aayega."
"8027","[AI-translation] Allah qayamat ke din logon ko jama karega; pas momin khade honge jab jannat un ke qareeb ki jayegi, wo Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae humare baap! Humare liye jannat kholo. Wo kahenge: Tumhein jannat se tumhare baap Adam ki khata ke siwa kis cheez ne nikala? Main is ka mustahiq nahi; apne bete Ibrahim Khalilullah ke paas jao. Ibrahim kahenge: Main is ka mustahiq nahi; main to parda ke peechhe se dost bana hun; Musa ke paas jao jis se Allah ne roo-ba-roo kalam kiya. Pas wo Musa ke paas aayenge; wo kahenge: Main is ka mustahiq nahi; Isa ke paas jao jo Allah ka kalima aur us ki rooh hain. Isa kahenge: Main is ka mustahiq nahi; Muhammad ke paas jao. Pas wo Muhammad ke paas aayenge; main uthunga aur mujhe ijazat di jayegi. Amanat aur reham bheje jayenge, wo pul-sirat ke donon kinaron par daayein aur baayein khade honge. Tum mein se pehla bijli ki tarah guzrega, phir hawa ki tarah, phir parinde ki tarah, phir tez daurne wale aadmi ki tarah; un ke amal unhein le kar daudenge. Aur tumhara nabi pul-sirat par khada hoga aur kahega: Ae mere Rab! Salamati, salamati; yahan tak ke bandon ke amal nakaam ho jayenge aur aisa aadmi aayega jo sirf ghisat kar ke chal sakta hoga. Pul-sirat ke kinaron par aise kaante latke honge jinhein hukm diya gaya hoga; wo jise pakadne ka hukm diya gaya use pakad lenge; koi chhil kar bach jayega aur koi dozakh mein dhakel diya jayega."
"8028","[AI-translation] Dajjal aayega aur zameen par qadam rakhega siwaye Makkah aur Madinah ke; pas wo Madina aayega aur us ke har darre par farishton ki safen payega. Phir wo Juraf ki shor-zameen mein aayega aur apna khaima lagayega; pas Madina teen martaba hilega aur us se har mard munafiq aur aurat munafiq nikal kar us ki taraf aayegi."
"8029","[AI-translation] Aik aadmi doosre ka haath pakde hue aayega aur kahega: Ae mere Rab! Is ne mujhe qatl kiya. Allah us se poochhega: Tum ne ise kyun qatl kiya? Wo kahega: Main ne ise is liye qatl kiya ke izzat tujh hi ke liye rahe. Allah farmayega: Beshak wo meri hi hai. Aur aik aadmi doosre ka haath pakde hue aayega aur kahega: Ae mere Rab! Is ne mujhe qatl kiya. Allah poochhega: Tum ne ise kyun qatl kiya? Wo kahega: Taake izzat fulan ki rahe. Farmayega: Wo to fulan ki nahi hai; pas wo apne gunah ke saath laut jayega."
"8030","[AI-translation] Quran qayamat ke din aayega aur kahega: Ae mere Rab! Ise izzat de, pas use izzat ka taj pehnaya jayega. Phir kahega: Ae mere Rab! Ise aur zyada de, pas use izzat ka joda pehnaya jayega. Phir kahega: Ae mere Rab! Us se raazi ho ja, pas us se raazi ho jayega. Phir kaha jayega: Padho aur chadhte jao; har aayat ke badle aik neki aur badhai jayegi."
"8031","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din maktool ko qatil ke saath laaya jayega, us ki peshani aur sar us ke haath mein hoga aur us ki gardan ki ragein khoon baha rahi hongi; wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Is se poochh ke is ne mujhe kyun qatl kiya? Yahan tak ke wo use Arsh ke qareeb le jayega."
"8032","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din maktool apne qatil ko pakad kar aayega; Allah farmayega: Tum ne ise kyun qatl kiya? Wo kahega: Fulan ki hukumat ke liye."
"8033","[AI-translation] Nabi qayamat ke din aayenge, un ke saath aik aadmi hoga; aik nabi ke saath do aadmi honge; aik nabi ke saath teen aur us se zyada honge. Un se kaha jayega: Kya tum ne apni qaum ko pahuncha diya? Wo kahenge: Haan. Pas un ki qaum ko bulaya jayega aur poocha jayega: Kya is ne tumhein pahunchaya? Wo kahenge: Nahi. Us se kaha jayega: Tumhare liye kaun gawahi dega? Wo kahenge: Muhammad aur un ki ummat. Pas Muhammad aur un ki ummat ko bulaya jayega aur un se poocha jayega: Kya is ne apni qaum ko pahunchaya? Wo kahenge: Haan. Poocha jayega: Tumhein is ka kya ilm hua? Wo kahenge: Humare nabi hamare paas aaye aur bataya ke Rasoolon ne pahuncha diya; pas hum ne un ki tasdeeq ki. Yehi Allah ka qaul hai: 'Aur isi tarah hum ne tumhein aik wasat wali ummat banaya taake tum logon par gawah ho aur Rasool tum par gawah ho.'"
"8034","[AI-translation] Nuh aur un ki ummat aayenge; Allah farmayega: Kya tum ne pahunchaya? Wo kahenge: Haan ae mere Rab! Phir us ki ummat se kaha jayega: Kya is ne tumhein pahunchaya? Wo kahenge: Nahi, hamare paas koi nabi nahi aaya. Nuh se kaha jayega: Tumhare liye kaun gawahi dega? Wo kahenge: Muhammad aur un ki ummat. Yehi Allah taala ka qaul hai: 'Aur isi tarah hum ne tumhein aik wasat wali ummat banaya taake tum logon par gawah ho.' Wasat ka matlab adl hai. Pas unhein bulaya jayega aur wo pahunchane ki gawahi denge; phir tum par meri gawahi li jayegi."
"8035","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din Musalmanon ke kuch log pahadon ke barabar gunahon ke saath aayenge, Allah unhein bakhsh dega aur unhein yahudiyon par daal dega."
"8036","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke adna shakhs ki panaah mein bhi panaah di jayegi."
"8037","[AI-translation] Allah us kaam karne wale ko pasand karta hai ke jab wo kaam kare to achha kare."
"8038","[AI-translation] Rezayat se wohi cheezein haram hoti hain jo nasab se haram hoti hain."
"8039","[AI-translation] Un ki wo khayanatein, nafarmaniyan aur jhoot jo unhon ne tumhare saath kiye, aur un ko tumhari saza, sab ka hisab karo. Pas agar tumhari saza un ke gunahon ke barabar ho to hisab barabar hai, na tumhare liye na tum par; aur agar tumhari saza un ke gunahon se kam ho to wo tumhare liye fazl hai; aur agar tumhari saza un ke gunahon se zyada ho to wo tum se fazl ka badla lenge. Kya tum Allah ki kitab nahi padhte: 'Aur hum qayamat ke din insaf ke tarazu qaim karenge' - aayat?"
"8040","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din takabbur karne walon ko chiyunton ki tarah uthaya jayega, insanon ki suraton mein; har taraf se zillat unhein dhak legi; unhein jahannam ke aik qaid-khane ki taraf hank diya jayega jise Bawlas kaha jata hai; un par Aniyar ki aag chadhegi aur unhein ahl-e-dozakh ke ras aur Khabal ki mitti pilayi jayegi."
"8041","[AI-translation] Logon ko teen tareeqon se hashr kiya jayega: raghbat karne wale aur darrne wale; do aadmi aik oont par, teen aik oont par, chaar aik oont par, das aik oont par; aur un ke baqi logon ko aag hashr karegi, wo un ke saath dopahar karegi jahan wo dopahar karenge, un ke saath raat guzaregi jahan wo raat guzarenge, un ke saath subah karegi jahan wo subah karenge aur un ke saath shaam karegi jahan wo shaam karenge."
"8042","[AI-translation] Logon ko un ki niyyaton par hashr kiya jayega."
"8043","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din logon ko nange pair, nange jism aur khatna-rawan hashr kiya jayega; maamla is se zyada sakht hoga ke wo aik doosre ko dekhein."
"8044","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din logon ko safed, gulabi zameen par hashr kiya jayega jaise safed aate ki roti, jis mein kisi ke liye koi nishan nahi hoga."
"8045","[AI-translation] Jumme mein teen qism ke log hazir hote hain: aik wo jo hazir hota hai aur laghw baat karta hai, ye us ka hissa hai; aik wo jo hazir hota hai aur dua karta hai, wo Allah azza wa jall se dua karta hai, agar chahe to de de aur agar chahe to na de; aur aik wo jo hazir hota hai khamoshi aur sukoon ke saath, kisi Musalman ki gardan na phalangta hai aur kisi ko takleef nahi deta, ye agle jumme tak kaffara hai aur teen din zyada; kyunke Allah farmata hai: 'Jo aik neki laaye us ke liye das guna hai.'"
"8046","[AI-translation] Shaheed aur apne bistar par marne wale apne Rab ke paas us ke baare mein jhagadenge jo taoon se marte hain. Shaheed kahenge: Ye humare bhai hain, jinhe qatl kiya gaya jaise hum qatl kiye gaye. Aur bistar par marne wale kahenge: Ye humare bhai hain, jo bistar par mare jaise hum mare. Pas Allah un ke darmiyan faisla karega aur farmayega: Un ke zakhm dekho; agar un ke zakhm qatl kiye gayon ke zakhm se milte hon to wo unhi mein se hain aur un ke saath honge. Pas wo taoon se marne walon ke zakhm dekhenge; jab un ke zakhm shaheedon ke zakhm se milte honge to wo un ke saath mila diye jayenge."
"8047","[AI-translation] Dajjal meri ummat mein niklega aur wo chalees rahega. Phir Allah taala Isa bin Maryam ko bhejega jo Urwah bin Masood Saqafi ke jaise honge; wo us ki talaash karenge aur use halak kar denge. Phir log saat saal rahenge jin mein do aadmiyon ke darmiyan koi dushmani nahi hogi. Phir Allah Sham ki taraf se thandi hawa bhejega; zameen par koi aisa shakhs baqi nahi rahega jis ke dil mein zarra barabar iman ho magar wo use qabz kar legi, yahan tak ke agar tum mein se koi pahad ki ghaar mein ghus jaye to wo bhi us ke paas dakhil ho kar use qabz kar legi. Pas bad-tareen log baqi rahenge, parinde ki tarah halke aur darindon ki aql wale; wo na kisi neki ko pehchange na kisi burai ko bura samjhenge. Pas shaitan un ke liye shakl ikhtiyar karega aur kahega: Kya tum jawab nahi do ge? Wo kahenge: Tum humein kya hukm dete ho? Pas wo unhein buton ki ibadat ka hukm dega aur wo un ki ibadat karenge, aur is halat mein un ka rizq chalta rahega aur un ki guzran achhi hogi. Phir soor phoonka jayega; jis ne bhi suna wo apna kaan lagayega aur gardan uthayega. Sab se pehle ise aik aadmi sunega jo apne oont ke hauz ko pukhta kar raha hoga; wo behosh ho jayega aur log bhi behosh ho jayenge. Phir Allah aisi barish bhejega jaise os, jis se logon ke jism ugenge. Phir doosri martaba soor phoonka jayega; pas wo khade ho kar dekhne lage. Phir kaha jayega: Ae logon! Apne Rab ki taraf chalo. Aur kaha jayega: Unhein roko, kyunke un se sawal kiya jayega. Phir kaha jayega: Dozakh ka giroh nikaalo. Poocha jayega: Kitne? Kaha jayega: Har hazaar mein se nau sau ninanwe. Ye wo din hoga jab bachche safed baal wale ho jayenge aur wo din jab pindli khol di jayegi."
"8048","[AI-translation] Dajjal niklega; us ki taraf mominon mein se aik aadmi aayega; use Dajjal ke sipahi milenge aur poochhenge: Tum kahan ja rahe ho? Wo kahega: Main us ki taraf ja raha hun jo nikla hai. Wo kahenge: Kya tum hamare Rab par iman nahi rakhte? Wo kahega: Hamare Rab par koi parda nahi. Wo kahenge: Use qatl kar do. Pas un mein se kuch log kuch se kahenge: Kya tumhare Rab ne tumhein mana nahi kiya ke us ke siwaye kisi ko qatl na karo? Pas wo use Dajjal ke paas le jayenge. Jab momin use dekhega to kahega: Ae logon! Yehi Dajjal hai jis ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne zikr kiya tha. Pas Dajjal us ke baare mein hukm dega aur wo us ke hawale kiya jayega; Dajjal kahega: Ise pakdo aur is ka sar phaad do. Pas us ka pait aur peeth maar se bhar di jayegi. Dajjal kahega: Kya tum mujh par iman nahi laate? Wo kahega: Tu Masih-e-Kazzab hai. Pas us ke baare mein hukm diya jayega aur use aari se us ke sar se le kar donon paon ke darmiyan tak chira diya jayega. Phir Dajjal donon tukdon ke darmiyan chalega aur us se kahega: Utho. Pas wo seedha khada ho jayega. Phir us se kahega: Kya tum mujh par iman laate ho? Wo kahega: Is se to mere ilm mein aur zyada izafa hua. Phir wo kahega: Ae logon! Mere baad ye kisi ke saath aisa nahi kar sakta. Pas Dajjal use pakad kar zibah karega aur us ki gardan se us ke hansli tak taanba kar dega, pas wo us tak rasai na pa sakega. Phir wo us ke haath aur pair pakad kar use phenk dega; log samjhenge ke us ne use aag mein phenka hai, halanke wo jannat mein daala gaya hoga. Ye Allah ke nazdeek sab se zyada gawahi wala aadmi hoga."
"8049","[AI-translation] Dajjal niklega aur us ke saath aik nahr aur aik aag hogi. Pas jo us ke nahr mein dakhil hoga us ka wazar wajib ho jayega aur uska ajr mit jayega, aur jo us ki aag mein dakhil hoga us ka ajr wajib ho jayega aur uska wazar mit jayega; phir ye to qayamat hi hai."
"8050","[AI-translation] Allah kuch logon ko aag se nikaal kar jannat mein dakhil karega."
"8051","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din aag se aik gardan niklegi jis ke do aankhein dekhengi, do kaan sunenge aur aik zaban bolengi; wo kahegi: Main teen qism ke logon par muqarrar ki gayi hun: har sarkash jabbar, har wo shakhs jo Allah ke saath doosre mabood ki dua karta hai, aur tasweerein banane wale."
"8052","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein aise log aayenge jinke daant chhote honge, aql halki hogi; wo apni zabanon se Quran padhenge magar wo un ke galon se aage nahi jayega; wo makhluq ke behtareen qaul ki baat karenge; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Pas jo un se mile use qatl kare, kyunke unhein qatl karne mein Allah ke nazdeek bara ajr hai."
"8053","[AI-translation] Tum mein aise log niklenge jin ke muqable mein tum apni namaz ko haqeer samjhoge, apne roze ko un ke roze ke muqable mein aur apne amal ko un ke amal ke muqable mein. Wo Quran padhenge magar wo un ke galon se aage nahi jayega; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Teer chalane wala teer ke phal ko dekhta hai to kuch nahi dekhta, phir teer ke dande ko dekhta hai to kuch nahi dekhta, phir paron ko dekhta hai to kuch nahi dekhta, aur shak karta hai ke teer ki naali par khoon ka koi nishan laga hai ya nahi."
"8054","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein aik qaum niklegi jo Quran padhegi magar wo un ke galon se aage nahi jayega; un ki nishani sar mundana hoga; pas jab tum un se milo to unhein qatl karo."
"8055","[AI-translation] Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki shafaat se kuch log aag se niklenge aur jannat mein dakhil honge; unhein Jahannami kaha jayega."
"8056","[AI-translation] Meri ummat mein se aik qaum niklegi jo Quran padhegi; tumhari qirat un ki qirat ke samne kuch nahi, tumhari namaz un ki namaz ke samne kuch nahi aur tumhare roze un ke roze ke samne kuch nahi. Wo Quran padhenge aur samjhenge ke ye un ke liye hai halanke ye un ke khilaf hai; un ki namaz un ke galon se aage nahi jayegi; wo Islam se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai. Agar wo lashkar jo unhein pakdega jaan le ke un ke nabi ne un ke liye kya faisla farmaya hai to wo amal se thak jayen. Un ki nishani ye hai ke un mein aik aadmi hoga jis ka baazu hoga magar us mein kohni se neeche baazu nahi hoga; us ke baazu ke sire par cholai ki nok ki tarah aik ubhaar hoga jis par safed baal honge."
"8057","[AI-translation] Mashriq se aise log niklenge jinke sar munde hue honge; wo apni zabanon se Quran padhenge magar wo un ke galon se aage nahi jayega; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai."
"8058","[AI-translation] Aag se chaar log niklenge aur unhein Allah ke saamne pesh kiya jayega; un mein se aik Allah ki taraf mutawajjeh hokar kahega: Ae mere Rab! Jab tune mujhe is se nikaala to ab is mein wapas na daalna. Pas Allah use is se nijaat de dega."
"8059","[AI-translation] Shafaat se kuch log aag se niklenge, wo chhote safed kumbhiyon ki tarah honge."
"8060","[AI-translation] Kuch log jalne ke baad aag se niklenge aur jannat mein dakhil honge; ahl-e-jannat unhein Jahannami kahenge."
"8061","[AI-translation] Jo 'La ilaha illallah' kahe aur us ke dil mein jau ke dane ke barabar khair ho wo aag se nikal aayega; phir jo 'La ilaha illallah' kahe aur us ke dil mein gehon ke dane ke barabar khair ho wo aag se nikal aayega; phir jo 'La ilaha illallah' kahe aur us ke dil mein zarra ke barabar khair ho wo aag se nikal aayega."
"8062","[AI-translation] Jo us ke dil mein zarra barabar iman rakhta ho wo aag se nikal aayega."
"8063","[AI-translation] Mashriq ki taraf se kuch log niklenge jo Quran padhenge magar wo un ke galon se aage nahi jayega; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai, phir us mein wapas nahi aayenge yahan tak ke teer apni nook ki taraf wapas chala jaye. Un ki nishani sar mundana hoga."
"8064","[AI-translation] Habsha ka do patli pindliyon wala aadmi Kabah ko dhwa dega."
"8065","[AI-translation] Allah ka haath jamaat ke saath hai."
"8066","[AI-translation] Allah ka haath bhara hua hai, use kharch kami nahi karta; raat din lutata rehta hai. Kya tum ne dekha ke aasman o zameen ki paidaish ke baad se us ne kitna kharch kiya? Phir bhi us ke haath mein koi kami nahi aayi. Aur uska Arsh paani par tha aur us ke haath mein tarazu hai, wo neecha karta hai aur upar uthata hai."
"8067","[AI-translation] Dene wale ka haath upar hota hai; un se shuru karo jinki parwarish tumhare zimme hai: tumhari maa, tumhare baap, tumhari behan, tumhara bhai, phir jo tum se qareeb ho, phir jo qareeb ho. Beshak koi jaan doosri jaan ka gunah nahi uthati."
"8068","[AI-translation] Jannat mein aise log dakhil honge jinke dil parindon ke dilon jaise honge."
"8069","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke aik aadmi ki shafaat se Banu Tamim se zyada log jannat mein dakhil honge."
"8070","[AI-translation] Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar ka aik giroh jannat mein dakhil hoga, un ke chehre badri raat ke chand ki tarah chamkenge."
"8071","[AI-translation] Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar log baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge; wo aise log hain jo jhada nahi karate, bad-shuguni nahi lete, dhaban nahi karate aur apne Rab par tawakkal karte hain."
"8072","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-jannat jannat mein nange jism, baal-kaatay hue, aankhon mein surma laga huye, tees saal ki umar ke hokar dakhil honge."
"8073","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-jannat jannat mein aur ahl-e-nar dozakh mein dakhil honge; phir Allah azza wa jall farmayega: Jis ke dil mein rai ke dane barabar iman ho use aag se nikaalo. Pas wo kaale hokar niklenge; phir unhein zindagi ke nahr mein daala jayega aur wo aise ugenge jaise sail ke kinare dana ugta hai. Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke wo peela aur tedha hokar nikalta hai?"
"8074","[AI-translation] Allah ahl-e-jannat ko jannat mein aur ahl-e-nar ko dozakh mein dakhil karega, phir un ke darmiyan aik munadi karne wala khada hoga aur kahega: Ae jannat walo! Ab koi maut nahi; aur ae dozakh walo! Ab koi maut nahi; har aik hamesha rahega us halat mein jis mein wo hai."
"8075","[AI-translation] Farishta nutfe ke paas aata hai jab wo reham mein chalees raat guzar jata hai, aur kahta hai: Ae mere Rab! Kya banega? Bad-qismat ya nek-qismat? Mard ya aurat? Pas Allah faisla farmata hai aur donon likh diye jate hain; us ka amal, us ka asar, us ki musibat, us ka rizq aur us ki maut likh di jate hain; phir sahifa lapet diya jata hai, us mein na kuch badhaya jata hai na ghataya jata hai."
"8076","[AI-translation] Musalmanon ke faqir apne ghani logon se aadha din pehle jannat mein dakhil honge, aur wo pandrah sau saal hai."
"8077","[AI-translation] Islam aise ghis jayega jaise kapde ka naqsh ghis jata hai, yahan tak ke log nahi jaanenge ke roza kya hai, namaz kya hai, nusuk kya hai aur sadqa kya hai; aur Allah ki kitab aik raat mein utha li jayegi, zameen par us ki koi aayat baqi nahi rahegi. Aur logon ke giroh baqi rahenge: boodha aur boodhi aurat, wo kahenge: Hum ne apne baapon ko isi kalime par paya, wo kahte the 'La ilaha illallah', pas hum bhi ise kahte hain."
"8078","[AI-translation] Nek log aik ke baad aik chale jayenge aur kapde ki tarah mail baqi rahegi jaise jau ya khajoor ka chhota tukra; Allah taala unhein kuch parwah nahi karega."
"8079","[AI-translation] Allah Umm-e-Ismail par reham kare; agar us ne Zamzam ko chhoda hota - ya farmaya: agar us ne paani se nichoda na hota - to wo behta hua chashma hota."
"8080","[AI-translation] Allah Umm-e-Ismail par reham kare; agar us ne jaldi na ki hoti to Zamzam behta hua chashma hota."
"8081","[AI-translation] Log aag mein jayenge phir apne amalon ke mutabiq us se niklenge: un mein se pehla palak jhapakne ki tarah, phir hawa ki tarah, phir ghode ki daud ki tarah, phir sawari par baithne wale ki tarah, phir aadmi ki tezi ki tarah, phir us ke chalne ki tarah."
"8082","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din mere ashaab ka aik giroh mere paas laaya jayega aur unhein Hoz se hata diya jayega; pas main kahunga: Ae mere Rab! Ye mere ashaab hain. Farmayega: Tumhein koi ilm nahi ke tumhare baad unhon ne kya nayee cheezein ijaad kiin; wo tumhare baad apni ediyon par ulte phir gaye."
"8083","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-nar par rona bheja jayega; wo rotay rahenge yahan tak ke un ke aansu khatam ho jayenge, phir khoon royenge yahan tak ke un ke chehron par aise khadde ban jayenge ke agar un mein kashtiyan chhori jayen to wo chal jayen."
"8084","[AI-translation] Log mujh se qayamat ke baare mein poochhte hain, halanke uska ilm Allah ke paas hai. Allah ki qasam, aaj zameen par jo bhi jaan hai us par sau saal guzarne se pehle maut aa jayegi."
"8085","[AI-translation] Tum mein se kisi ki dua qabool hoti hai jab tak wo jaldi na kare aur na kahe: Main ne dua ki magar meri dua qabool nahi hui."
"8086","[AI-translation] Aasani karo, mushkil na karo; khushkhabri do, nafrat na dilao."
"8087","[AI-translation] Aasani karo, mushkil na karo; khushkhabri do, nafrat na dilao; aik doosre ki itaat karo aur ikhtilaf na karo."
"8088","[AI-translation] Sawar chalne wale ko, chalne wala khade wale ko aur thode bohat ko salaam kahen."
"8089","[AI-translation] Sawar chalne wale ko, chalne wala baithne wale ko aur thode bohat ko salaam kahen."
"8090","[AI-translation] Chhota bade ko, chalne wala baithne wale ko aur thode bohat ko salaam kahen."
"8091","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke kuch log sharaab piyenge aur us ka naam doosra rakhenge."
"8092","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke kuch log sharaab piyenge aur use us ke ghair naam se pukarenge."
"8093","[AI-translation] Shaheed apne ghar walon mein se sattar logon ki shafaat karega."
"8094","[AI-translation] Chheenkne wale ka jawab teen martaba do; jo us se zyada ho wo zukam hai."
"8095","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din meri ummat ke aik aadmi ko tamam makhluq ke saron par pukara jayega aur us ke liye ninanwe register khol diye jayenge; har register nazar bhar lamba hoga. Phir Allah tabarak wa taala farmayega: Kya tum in mein se kisi cheez ka inkar karte ho? Wo kahega: Nahi ae mere Rab! Farmayega: Kya tumhare upar mere likhne wale hifazat karne wale zulm kiye? Wo kahega: Nahi ae mere Rab! Phir farmayega: Kya tumhare paas koi uzr hai ya koi neki hai? Wo aadmi darr jayega aur kahega: Nahi. Farmayega: Kyun nahi, beshak hamare paas tumhari aik neki hai aur aaj tum par koi zulm nahi hoga. Pas us ke liye aik parcha nikala jayega jis mein likha hoga: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain. Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab! Ye parcha in registeron ke saath kya hai? Farmayega: Beshak tum par zulm nahi kiya jayega. Pas register aik palde mein rakhe jayenge aur parcha doosre palde mein; register halke ho jayenge aur parcha bhari ho jayega."
"8096","[AI-translation] Ibn Adam ke har jor par har subah sadqa hota hai: tumhara jis se milo use salaam karna sadqa hai, neki ka hukm dena sadqa hai, burai se rokna sadqa hai, raaste se takleef-deh cheez hatana sadqa hai, aur apni biwi ke paas jana sadqa hai. In sab ke badle chasht ki do rakatein kafi hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasoolullah! Hum mein se koi apni shahwat poori karta hai to us ke liye sadqa hai? Farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal, agar wo use haram mein rakhta to us par gunah na hota?"
"8097","[AI-translation] Tum mein se har aik ke har jor par har subah sadqa hai: har tasbeeh sadqa hai, har tahmeed sadqa hai, har tehleel sadqa hai, har takbeer sadqa hai, neki ka hukm sadqa hai, burai se rokna sadqa hai; aur in sab ke liye chasht ki do rakatein kafi hain."
"8098","[AI-translation] Tum mein se har aik ke har jor par har din sadqa hai: us ke liye har namaz sadqa hai, roza sadqa hai, hajj sadqa hai, tasbeeh sadqa hai, takbeer sadqa hai, tahmeed sadqa hai; aur tum mein se kisi ke liye chasht ki do rakatein in sab ke badle kafi hain."
"8099","[AI-translation] Wo tumhari imamat karte hain; pas agar wo durust parhein to tumhare liye hai, aur agar wo galti karein to bhi tumhare liye hai aur un par hai."
"8100","[AI-translation] Allah un do aadmiyon par hansa karta hai jin mein aik doosre ko qatl karta hai aur donon jannat mein dakhil hote hain: ye Allah ki raah mein larta hai aur qatl ho jata hai; phir Allah qatil ki tauba qabool karta hai, wo Musalman hota hai, phir Allah ki raah mein larta hai aur shaheed ho jata hai."
"8101","[AI-translation] Allah qayamat ke din aasmanon ko lapet lega, phir unhein apne daayein haath mein lega aur farmayega: Main Malik hun; kahan hain jabbar? Kahan hain takabbur karne wale? Phir zameenon ko lapet kar apne baayein haath mein lega aur farmayega: Main Malik hun; kahan hain jabbar? Kahan hain takabbur karne wale?"
"8102","[AI-translation] Tumhara Rab us charwahe par khush hota hai jo pahad ki choti par bakriyan charata hai, azaan deta hai aur namaz parhta hai; Allah azza wa jall farmata hai: Mere is bande ko dekho, azaan aur iqamat deta hai, mujh se darta hai; main ne apne bande ko bakhsh diya aur use jannat mein dakhil kar diya."
"8103","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-tauheed mein se kuch logon ko azab diya jayega aur unhein aag mein daal diya jayega yahan tak ke wo us mein koyla ban jayenge; phir unhein rehmat mil jayegi aur wo nikal aayenge aur unhein jannat ke darwazon par rakha jayega; ahl-e-jannat un par paani chhidkenge aur wo aise ugenge jaise sail ke kachre mein ghaas ugti hai; phir wo jannat mein dakhil honge."
"8104","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din logon ko itna pasina aayega ke un ka pasina zameen mein sattar gaz neeche chala jayega aur unhein lagam ki tarah un ke kaanon tak pahunch jayega."
"8105","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne bhai ko aise daant kaatta hai jaise oont? Us par koi diyat nahi."
"8106","[AI-translation] Momin ko jannat mein aurton ke maamle mein sau aadmiyon ki taaqat di jayegi."
"8107","[AI-translation] Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke sar ke peechhe teen girah lagata hai jab wo sota hai; har girah par haath maar kar kehta hai: Tumhare liye lambi raat hai, so jao. Pas agar wo jaag kar Allah ko yaad kare to aik girah khul jati hai; phir wuzu kare to doosri girah khul jati hai; phir namaz parhe to us ki tamam girahein khul jati hain; pas wo subah khush-dil aur chust hokar uthta hai, warna bura dil aur sust hokar uthta hai."
"8108","[AI-translation] Ladke ki taraf se aqiqa karo aur us ka sar khoon se na chhuo."
"8109","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi aag ka angara utha kar apne haath mein rakhta hai."
"8110","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi namaz mein oont ki tarah baithta hai?!"
"8111","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apni biwi ko ghulam ki tarah koda hai, phir shayad usi din ke aakhir mein us ke paas sota hai."
"8112","[AI-translation] Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas aata hai aur use darata hai, phir wo subah ja kar logon ko batata hai?!"
"8113","[AI-translation] Aik panaah lene wala Baitullah ki panaah lega, pas us ki taraf aik lashkar bheja jayega; jab wo zameen ke aik bayaban mein honge to unhein zameen mein dhansa diya jayega. Poocha gaya: Ae Rasoolullah! Us ke baare mein kya hukm hai jo majboori se un ke saath ho? Farmaya: Use bhi un ke saath dhansa diya jayega magar qayamat ke din us ki niyyat par uthaya jayega."
"8114","[AI-translation] Qabah par chadhai karne ke liye aik lashkar aayega; jab wo zameen ke aik bayaban mein honge to un ke awwal aur aakhir ko dhansa diya jayega, phir unhein un ki niyyaton par uthaya jayega."
"8115","[AI-translation] Is ghar par aik lashkar chadhai karega, pas unhein bayaban mein dhansa diya jayega."
"8116","[AI-translation] Bartan ko saat martaba dhoo jab kutta us mein munh daal de; aakhri martaba ya pehli martaba mitti se; aur agar billi us mein munh daal de to aik martaba dhoo."
"8117","[AI-translation] Ladki ke peshab se dhoo aur ladke ke peshab par paani chhidak do."
"8118","[AI-translation] Mujh par ghazab kiya jata hai ke main apne paas dene ke liye kuch na paun?! Tum mein se jis ne maanga aur us ke paas aik auqiya ya us ke barabar ho to us ne israr se maanga."
"8119","[AI-translation] Shaheed ke tamam gunah bakhsh diye jate hain siwaye qarz ke."
"8120","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-jannat se kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo! Hamesha raho, koi maut nahi; aur ahl-e-nar se: Ae dozakh walo! Hamesha raho, koi maut nahi."
"8121","[AI-translation] Quran wale se kaha jayega jab wo jannat mein dakhil hoga: Padho aur chadho. Pas wo padhega aur chadhta jayega, har aayat ke badle aik darja, yahan tak ke wo apne saath jo aakhri cheez hai use padh le."
"8122","[AI-translation] Quran wale se kaha jayega: Padho aur chadho aur tarteel se padho jaise duniya mein tarteel se padhte the; kyunke tumhara maqam tumhari aakhri aayat ke paas hoga jo tum padhte the."
"8123","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din ahl-e-nar ke aik aadmi se kaha jayega: Tumhara kya khayal, agar zameen bhar cheez tumhari hoti to kya tum us se chhutkara paate? Wo kahega: Haan. Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha; main ne tum se is se aasan cheez maangi thi jab tum Adam ki pusht mein the ke mere saath kisi ko shareek na karo, magar tum ne inkar kiya aur shareek kiya."
"8124","[AI-translation] Ilm qabz kar liya jayega, jahalat aur fitne zahir honge aur harj zyada hoga."
"8125","[AI-translation] Allah qayamat ke din zameen ko qabz karega aur aasmanon ko apne daayein haath se lapet lega, phir farmayega: Main Malik hun; kahan hain zameen ke badshah?"
"8126","[AI-translation] Ibn Maryam Dajjal ko Lud ke darwaze par qatl karenge."
"8127","[AI-translation] Muhrim ... inhein qatl kar sakta hai: katne wala kutta, chooha, bichchhu, cheel aur kawwa."
"8128","[AI-translation] Namaz ko gadha, aurat aur kutta tor deta hai."
"8129","[AI-translation] Namaz ko haiz wali aurat aur kala kutta tor deta hai."
"8130","[AI-translation] Namaz ko aurat, gadha aur kutta tor dete hain; aur in se bachao sawari ke peechhe ki lakri ke barabar cheez se hota hai."
"8131","[AI-translation] Aadmi ki namaz us waqt tot jati hai jab us ke saamne sawari ke peechhe ki lakri ke barabar bhi parda na ho: aurat, gadha aur kala kutta; kala kutta shaitan hai."
"8132","[AI-translation] Ibn Adam kahta hai: Mera maal, mera maal. Aur ae ibn Adam! Tumhare maal mein se tumhara wohi hai jo tum ne khaya aur khatam kiya, ya pehna aur purana kiya, ya sadqa diya aur aage bheja; is ke siwa jo hai wo jaane wala hai aur logon ke liye chhodne wala."
"8133","[AI-translation] Banda kahta hai: Mera maal, mera maal; halanke us ke maal mein se us ke liye teen cheezein hain: jo us ne khaya aur khatam kiya, jo pehna aur purana kiya, ya jo diya aur aage bheja; is ke siwa jo hai wo jaane wala hai aur logon ke liye chhodne wala."
"8134","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din banda kahega: Ae mere Rab! Kya tune mujhe zulm se amaan nahi di? Allah farmayega: Kyun nahi. Wo kahega: Main apne upar kisi ki gawahi qabool nahi karta magar apne hi mein se kisi ki. Allah farmayega: 'Aaj tum par gawah ke taur par tumhara apna nafs kafi hai' aur karam likhne wale farishte gawah honge. Pas us ke munh par mohar lag di jayegi aur us ke aaza se kaha jayega: Bolo; pas wo us ke amal batayenge. Phir use baat karne ki ijazat di jayegi, wo kahega: Tumhara halak ho aur door ho; main tumhari taraf se hi larta jhagarta tha."
"8135","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Meri raah mein jihad karne wala mere zimme hai; agar main use qabz kar lun to use jannat ka waris bana dun, aur agar main use wapas laaun to use ajr ya ghanimat ke saath wapas laaun."
"8136","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke mere baare mein achhe gumaan ke saath hun aur jab wo mujhe pukarta hai to main us ke saath hun."
"8137","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke mere baare mein achhe gumaan ke saath hun aur jab wo mujhe yaad karta hai to main us ke saath hun. Pas agar wo mujhe apne dil mein yaad kare to main use apne dil mein yaad karta hun; aur agar wo mujhe majlis mein yaad kare to main use un se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun; aur agar wo mere qareeb aik balisht aaye to main us se aik gaz qareeb hota hun; aur agar wo aik gaz qareeb aaye to main us se aik ba' qareeb hota hun; aur agar wo chal kar mere paas aaye to main daud kar us ke paas jata hun."
"8138","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke mere baare mein achhe gumaan ke saath hun aur jab wo mujhe yaad karta hai to main us ke saath hun. Allah ki qasam, Allah apne bande ki tauba se us se zyada khush hota hai jo tum mein se koi bayaban mein apni gum-shuda cheez pa kar hota hai. Aur jo mere qareeb aik balisht aaye to main us se aik gaz qareeb hota hun; aur jo aik gaz qareeb aaye to main us se aik ba' qareeb hota hun; aur agar wo chal kar meri taraf aaye to main daud kar us ki taraf jata hun."
"8139","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Mere momin bande ke liye mere paas jab main us ke kisi aziz ko duniya se qabz kar lun aur wo sawab ki umeed rakhe, to jannat ke siwa koi badla nahi."
"8140","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Jis ki do piyari aankhein main le lun aur wo sabr kare aur sawab ki umeed rakhe, main us ke liye jannat ke siwa kisi badle par raazi nahi."
"8141","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Jo aik neki kare us ke liye das guna aur us se zyada hai; aur jo burai kare us ka badla us jaisa hai ya main maaf kar dun; aur jo zameen bhar khata kare phir mujh se mile aur mere saath kisi ko shareek na kare, main us ke liye us ke barabar bakhshish bana dun. Jo mere qareeb aik balisht aaye main us se aik gaz qareeb hota hun; jo aik gaz qareeb aaye main us se aik ba' qareeb hota hun; jo chal kar mere paas aaye main daud kar us ke paas jata hun."
"8142","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Ae Adam! Wo kahega: Labbaik wa sa'daik, khair tere haath mein hai. Farmayega: Dozakh ka giroh nikaal. Wo kahega: Dozakh ka giroh kya hai? Farmayega: Har hazaar mein se nau sau ninanwe. Us waqt bachcha boodha ho jayega; 'aur har hamal wali apna hamal daal degi aur tum logon ko nashe mein dekhenge halanke wo nashe mein nahi honge magar Allah ka azab sakht hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasoolullah! Hum mein se wo aik kaun hoga? Farmaya: Khushkhabri ho, kyunke tum mein se aik aur Yajuj Majuj se hazaar. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, mujhe umeed hai ke tum jannat walon ka chautha hissa hoge; mujhe umeed hai ke tum teesra hissa hoge; mujhe umeed hai ke tum aadha hissa hoge. Tum logon mein aise hi ho jaise safed bail ki khaal mein kaala baal ya kaale bail ki khaal mein safed baal ya gadhe ke baazu par nishan."
"8143","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Ae ibn Adam! Jab main tumhari do anmol cheezein le lun aur tum sabr karo aur pehli chot par sawab ki umeed rakho, to main tumhare liye jannat ke siwa kisi badle par raazi nahi."
"8144","[AI-translation] Allah taala farmata hai: Ae ibn Adam! Tum mujhe kyun majboor karte ho halanke main ne tumhein aisi cheez se paida kiya? Yahan tak ke jab main ne tumhein durust kiya aur barabar kiya to tum do chadoron ke darmiyan chalte ho aur zameen tumhare bojh se dheemi awaaz karti hai; tum jama karte ho aur rok lete ho; yahan tak ke jab jaan galon tak pahunchti hai to tum kahte ho: Main sadqa karun. Aur ab sadqe ka waqt kahan hai?!"
"8145","[AI-translation] Log kahte hain: Karam - halanke karam to momin ka dil hai."
"8146","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne pasine mein kaanon tak doob kar khada hoga."
"8147","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi apne chehre ko jahannam ki garmi se bachaye chahe aik khajoor ya khajoor ka tukra de kar. Beshak tum mein se har aik Allah se milega aur wo us se wohi kahega jo main tum mein se kisi se kahta hun: Kya main ne tumhein kaan aur aankh nahi di? Wo kahega: Kyun nahi. Farmayega: Kya main ne tumhein maal aur aulad nahi di? Wo kahega: Kyun nahi. Farmayega: Tum ne apne liye kya aage bheja? Pas wo apne aage, peeche, daayein aur baayein dekhega, phir kuch na payega jo us ke chehre ko jahannam ki garmi se bachaye. Pas tum mein se har aik apne chehre ko aag se bachaye chahe khajoor ka tukra de kar; agar wo bhi na mile to achhi baat se. Kyunke main tumhare faqr ka darr nahi rakhta; beshak Allah tumhara madadgar hai aur tumhein deta rahega yahan tak ke ek aurat apni sawari par Yathrib aur Hira ke darmiyan safar karegi aur us ki sawari ke baare mein sab se zyada darr chori ka hoga."
"8148","[AI-translation] Mere baad tum par aise ameer honge jo namaz ko der se parhayenge; pas wo tumhare liye hai aur un par hai. Un ke saath namaz parho jab tak wo tumhein Qibla ki taraf namaz parhate rahen."
"8149","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein zameen dhansna, pathar barasna aur shakal bigadna hoga."
"8150","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein aik khalifa hoga jo maal baantega aur ginega nahi."
"8151","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein jhoote dajjal log aayenge jo tumhare paas aisi hadithon ke saath aayenge jo na tum ne suni hongi na tumhare baapon ne; pas un se aur un ki hadithon se bacho, kahin wo tumhein gumrah na karen aur fitne mein na daal den."
"8152","[AI-translation] ... Suno! Jo cheez zinda janwar se kaati jaye wo murdar hai."
"8153","[AI-translation] Aakhri zamane mein aise log honge jo kaale rang se khizab karenge jaise kabootar ke pait; wo jannat ki khushbu nahi paenge."
"8154","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke aakhir mein aik khalifa hoga jo maal ko dono hathon se lutayega aur ginega nahi."
"8155","[AI-translation] Meri ummat mein zameen dhansna, shakal bigadna aur pathar barasna hoga."
"8156","[AI-translation] Is ummat ke aakhir mein zameen dhansna, shakal bigadna aur pathar barasna hoga. Poocha gaya: Ae Rasoolullah! Kya hum halak honge halanke hum mein nek log honge? Farmaya: Haan, jab khabasat zahir ho jaye."
"8157","[AI-translation] Mere baad baarah ameer honge, wo sab Qureish se honge."
"8158","[AI-translation] Ibrahim qayamat ke din apne baap Aazar se milenge aur Aazar ke chehre par ghubar aur khak hoga. Ibrahim us se kahenge: Kya main ne tum se nahi kaha tha ke meri nafarmani na karo? Us ke baap kahenge: Aaj main tumhari nafarmani nahi karunga. Ibrahim kahenge: Ae mere Rab! Tune mujh se wada kiya tha ke jis din log uthaye jayenge us din mujhe ruswa na karega; aur is se bara ruswai kya hogi ke mera baap hi door wala ho? Allah farmayega: Main ne jannat kafiron par haram kar di hai. Phir kaha jayega: Ae Ibrahim! Apne pairon ke darmiyan dekho. Pas wo dekhenge to wahan aik maila dhabba hoga; us ke pair pakad kar use aag mein phenk diya jayega."
"8159","[AI-translation] Isa ki hujjat un ke is qaul mein hogi: 'Aur jab Allah farmayega: Ae Isa bin Maryam! Kya tum ne logon se kaha tha ke mujhe aur meri maa ko Allah ke siwa do mabood bana lo?' To Allah unhein jawab dega: 'Teri zaat paak hai, mujhe haq nahi ke main aisi baat kahun jo mere liye durust na ho' - poori aayat."
"8160","[AI-translation] Mere ahle bait mein se aik aadmi hoga jis ka naam mere naam se milta hoga; agar duniya mein aik din bhi baqi rahega to Allah us din ko lamba kar dega yahan tak ke wo hukumat karega."
"8161","[AI-translation] Muhajir apna nusuk poori karne ke baad Makkah mein teen din rahega."
"8162","[AI-translation] Ghode ki barkat us ke surkh rang mein hai."
"8163","[AI-translation] Tumhari qasam usi baat par mu'tabar hai jis par tumhara saathi tumhein sachcha samjhe."
"8164","[AI-translation] Aik munadi pukarega: Tumhare liye ye hai ke tum sehat-mand raho, kabhi beemar na ho; tumhare liye ye hai ke tum zinda raho, kabhi maut na aaye; tumhare liye ye hai ke tum jawan raho, kabhi boodhe na ho; tumhare liye ye hai ke tum naimat mein raho, kabhi takleef na uthao."
"8165","[AI-translation] Allah taala har raat aasman-e-duniya par utarta hai jab raat ka pehla tihai guzar jata hai, phir farmata hai: Main Malik hun, main Malik hun; kaun hai jo mujhe pukare to main us ki dua qabool karun? Kaun hai jo mujh se maange to main use dun? Kaun hai jo mujh se bakhshish maange to main use bakhsh dun? Wo isi halat mein rehta hai yahan tak ke fajr roshan ho jati hai."
"8166","[AI-translation] Allah taala raat ke aakhri tihai mein aasman-e-duniya par utarta hai aur farmata hai: Kaun hai jo mujhe pukare to main us ki dua qabool karun ya mujh se maange to main use dun? Phir apne donon haath phelata hai aur farmata hai: Kaun hai jo aise ko qarz de jo na muflis hai na zalim?"
"8167","[AI-translation] Allah har raat aasman-e-duniya par utarta hai aur farmata hai: Kya koi maangne wala hai ke main use dun? Kya koi bakhshish maangne wala hai ke main use bakhsh dun? Kya koi tauba karne wala hai ke main us ki tauba qabool karun? Yahan tak ke fajr roshan ho jati hai."
"8168","[AI-translation] Humara Rab tabarak wa taala har raat aasman-e-duniya par utarta hai jab raat ka aakhri tihai baqi reh jata hai, phir farmata hai: Kaun hai jo mujhe pukare to main us ki dua qabool karun? Kaun hai jo mujh se maange to main use dun? Kaun hai jo mujh se bakhshish maange to main use bakhsh dun?"
"8169","[AI-translation] Isa bin Maryam Damishq ke mashriqi safed minar ke paas utrenge."
"8170","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke kuch log aik aise dagle maidan mein utrenge jise wo Basra kahenge, Dajla naam ke nahr ke kinare; us par aik pul hoga, us ke log bohat honge aur wo Musalmanon ke shahron mein se hoga. Pas jab aakhri zamana aayega to Qantura ki nasal ke log aayenge, chaura chehron aur chhoti aankhon wale, yahan tak ke wo nahr ke kinare utrenge. Pas us ke log teen girohon mein bant jayenge: aik giroh bakriyon aur jungle ki taraf chala jayega aur halak ho jayega; aik giroh apne liye duniya pakdega aur kufr karega; aur aik giroh apni aulad ko apni peethon ke peechhe kar ke un se larega, aur wohi shaheed honge."
"8171","[AI-translation] Aise log uth kar niklenge jo Quran padhenge magar wo un ke galon se aage nahi jayega; jab bhi koi giroh niklega wo kaat diya jayega, jab bhi koi giroh niklega wo kaat diya jayega, yahan tak ke un ke aakhri mein Dajjal niklega."
"8172","[AI-translation] Ladke ke peshab par paani chhidko aur ladki ke peshab ko dhoo."
"8173","[AI-translation] Ibn Adam boodha hota hai aur us ke saath do cheezein baqi rehti hain: hirs aur umeed."
"8174","[AI-translation] Ibn Adam boodha hota hai magar us mein do cheezein jawan rehti hain: maal ki hirs aur lambi umar ki hirs."
"8175","[AI-translation] Qureish ka yehi giroh logon ko halak karega. Unhon ne kaha: To aap humein kya hukm dete hain? Farmaya: Kaash log un se alag ho jayen."
"8176","[AI-translation] Madina wale Zul-Hulaifa se, Sham wale Juhfa se, Najd wale Qarn se aur Yemen wale Yalamlam se ihram bandhenge."
"8177","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din ahl-e-aafiyat umeed karenge ke kaash un ki khaal duniya mein qainchi se kaat di gayi hoti, jab unhein aafiyat walon ko sawab diya jayega."
"8178","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke tum mein se koi fajr ki chaar rakatein parhe."
"8179","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke Firat apne neeche sone ka pahad khol de; pas jab log us ki khabar sunenge to us ki taraf jayenge, aur us ke paas jo hoga kahega: Allah ki qasam, agar hum logon ko is se lene denge to wo ise poora le jayenge; pas wo us par larenge yahan tak ke har sau mein se ninanwe qatl ho jayenge."
"8180","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke Firat sone ka khazana khol de; pas jo us ke paas ho wo us mein se kuch na le."
"8181","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke Musalman Madina mein gher liye jayen yahan tak ke un ka sab se door markaz Salah hoga."
"8182","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke log aik doosre se sawal karenge yahan tak ke un mein kaunsi kehne wala kahega: Allah ne makhluq ko paida kiya, phir Allah ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jab wo aisa kahen to tum kaho: 'Allah aik hai, Allah be-niyaz hai, na us ne kisi ko janm diya na wo kisi se paida hua, aur us ke barabar koi nahi.' Phir apni baayein taraf teen martaba thook do aur shaitan se panaah maango."
"8183","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke ummatein tum par har taraf se is tarah toot paren jaise khane wale apne bartan par tootte hain. Poocha gaya: Ae Rasoolullah! Us din kya hum thode honge? Farmaya: Nahi, balke tum bohat hoge magar tum sail ke jhaag ki tarah hoge; Allah tumhare dilon mein kamzori daal dega aur tumhare dushman ke dilon se tumhara ruaab nikal dega, tumhari duniya ki mohabbat aur maut ki nafrat ki wajah se."
"8184","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai, agar tumhari umar lambi hui, to tum aise log dekho ge jinke haathon mein gaay ki dum jaisa hoga; wo Allah ke ghazab mein subah karenge aur Allah ki na-khushi mein shaam karenge."
"8185","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke aisa zamana aaye jis mein logon ko chalni ki tarah chhan diya jayega aur logon ki reeth baqi rahegi jinke ahad aur amanat kharab ho chuke honge aur wo ikhtilaf karenge aur aise ho jayenge - aur aap ne apni ungliyan milayin. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rasoolullah! Hum kya karen? Farmaya: Tum wo pakdo jo tum jaante ho aur chhod do jo tum inkar karte ho; apne khaas muamle ki taraf mutawajjeh ho jao aur aam logon ke muamle ko chhod do."
"8186","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke aik aadmi apne takht par takiya lagaye aur meri hadithon mein se hadith bayan kare aur kahe: Hamare aur tumhare darmiyan Allah ki kitab hai; jo us mein halal paya hum ne use halal kiya aur jo us mein haram paya hum ne use haram kiya. Suno! Beshak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jo haram kiya wo bhi Allah ke haram karne ki tarah hai."
"8187","[AI-translation] Qareeb hai ke Musalman ke maal mein sab se behtar bakriyan hongi jinhein wo pahadon ki chotiyon aur barish ke maqamat par le kar chalega, apne deen ko fitnon se bachane ke liye bhaagta hua."
"8188","[AI-translation] Ae Muaz! Qareeb hai, agar tumhari zindagi lambi hui, to tum dekho ge ke ye jagah baaghon se bhar di gayi hai."
"8189","[AI-translation] Pul-sirat jahannam ke darmiyan rakha jayega; us par aise kaante honge jaise sa'dan ke kaante. Phir log us par se guzrenge: koi bachne wala Musalman hoga, koi chhil kar bachega, phir koi bachega aur koi rok liya jayega, aur koi us mein ulta latka diya jayega."
"8190","[AI-translation] Jumme ke din baarah ghante hain; un mein aik aisa ghanta hai ke us mein koi Musalman banda Allah se jo maange Allah use de deta hai; pas ise asr ke baad ke aakhri ghante mein talash karo."
"8191","[AI-translation] Yawm-ul-Hajj-il-Akbar qurbani ka din hai."
"8192","[AI-translation] Eid-ul-Fitr, Eid-ul-Adha aur Ayyam-e-Tashreeq hum Ahle-Islam ki eid hain; ye khane peene ke din hain."
"8193","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din mominon ke liye itna hoga jitna zohar aur asr ke darmiyan ka waqt."
"8194","[AI-translation] Yateem ladki se us ke baare mein ijazat li jati hai; agar wo khamosh rahe to yehi us ki ijazat hai, aur agar wo inkar kare to us par zabardasti jayez nahi."
"8195","[AI-translation] Upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai; aur un se shuru karo jinki parwarish tumhare zimme hai."
"8196","[AI-translation] Upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai; aur un se shuru karo jinki parwarish tumhare zimme hai. Behtar sadqa wo hai jo ghani hokar kiya jaye; jo ghina chahta hai Allah use ghani karta hai aur jo parhez chahta hai Allah use parhezgari deta hai."
"8197","[AI-translation] Upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai; upar wala haath kharch karne wala hai aur neeche wala maangne wala."
"8198","[AI-translation] Qasam usi baat par hai jis par tumhara saathi tumhein sachcha bataye."
"8199","[AI-translation] Qasam us ki niyyat par hai jo qasam khilwata hai."
"8200","[AI-translation] Yawm-ul-Ma'ood qayamat ka din hai, Shahid jumme ka din hai aur Mashhood Arafah ka din hai; jumme ke din ko Allah ne hamare liye zakhira banaya hai; aur namaz-e-wusta asr ki namaz hai."
"8201","[AI-translation] Yawm-ul-Ma'ood qayamat ka din hai, Yawm-ul-Mashhood Arafah ka din hai aur Shahid jumme ka din hai; suraj kisi aise din par na tulu hua na ghuroob hua jo jumme se behtar ho. Us mein aik aisa waqt hai ke koi Musalman banda us mein Allah se bhala maange to Allah us ki dua qabool karta hai, aur kisi burai se panaah maange to Allah use us se bacha leta hai."
"8202","[AI-translation] Yahudi maghzub-aleh hain aur Nasrani gumrah."
